#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:4 ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:42
msgid "Drawing Animation Levels"
msgstr "绘制动画层级"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:5
msgid ""
"In OpenToonz it is possible to create and draw **Toonz Vector** levels (PLI format), **Toonz Raster** levels (TLV format) and standard **Raster** levels (TIF format) directly in the viewer. Drawing tools can also be used for "
"touch-up in cleaned up drawings, and loaded raster images."
msgstr "在 OpenToonz 中，可以直接在检视器中创建和绘制 **Toonz 矢量** 层级（PLI 格式）、**Toonz 栅格** 层级（TLV 格式）和标准 **栅格** 层级（TIF 格式）。绘图工具也可用于清理后的描线润色以及已加载的栅格图像。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:10
msgid "Drawing In OpenToonz"
msgstr "在 OpenToonz 中绘制"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:11
msgid "To draw an animation level, first you have to define its type: Toonz Vector, Toonz Raster or Raster; and its settings like its name, the number of frames it's made of and the way its drawings are numbered."
msgstr "要绘制动画层级，首先需要定义其类型：Toonz 矢量、Toonz 栅格或栅格；以及其设置，如名称、构成帧数及其绘图的编号方式。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:13
msgid ""
"Toonz Vector levels are defined by drawing of vector strokes; strokes and areas defined by strokes can be painted by using the styles available in the level palette. Toonz Vector levels have an unlimited size and resolution, "
"as they are vector-based. They are saved as PLI files."
msgstr "Toonz 矢量层级通过绘制矢量笔触定义；笔触及由笔触定义的区域可以使用层级调色板中的样式进行上色。Toonz 矢量层级具有无限的大小和分辨率，因为它们是基于矢量的。它们保存为 PLI 文件。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:15
msgid ""
"Toonz Raster levels are defined by drawing bitmap lines; lines and areas defined by lines can be painted by using the styles available in the level palette. Toonz Raster levels have a specified size and resolution, defined "
"when they are created. They are saved as TLV files."
msgstr "Toonz 栅格层级通过绘制位图线条定义；线条及由线条定义的区域可以使用层级调色板中的样式进行上色。Toonz 栅格层级具有创建时指定的固定大小和分辨率。它们保存为 TLV 文件。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:17
msgid ""
"Raster levels are defined by drawing bitmap lines using the styles available in the **Raster Drawing Palette**, that is shared by all of the Raster levels of the same project (see  :ref:`Project Default Folders "
"<project_default_folders>`  ). Raster levels have a specified size and resolution, defined when they are created. They are saved as sequences of individual TIF files, one per level frame."
msgstr ""
"栅格层级通过使用 **栅格绘图调色板** 中的样式绘制位图线条定义，该调色板由同一项目的所有栅格层级共享（参见 :ref:`项目默认文件夹 <project_default_folders>`）。栅格层级具有创建时指定的固定大小和分辨率。它们保存为单独的 TIF 文件序"
"列，每个层级帧对应一个文件。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:19
msgid ""
"When an animation level is defined, you can select any of its frames in the Xsheet/Timeline or in the Level Strip, and start drawing in the viewer. You can do this both, when you want to create a drawing from scratch, and when "
"you want to edit a previously made drawing."
msgstr "定义动画层级后，您可以在摄影表/时间轴或层级条中选择其任意帧，然后在检视器中开始绘制。无论是想从头创建绘图，还是想编辑先前制作的绘图，都可以这样做。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:21
msgid ""
"When selected in the Xsheet/Timeline, the viewer displays the whole scene content at the current frame; when selected in the Level Strip, the viewer displays the selected frame of the current animation level only, to let you "
"work more easily on it."
msgstr "在摄影表/时间轴中选中时，检视器显示当前帧的整个场景内容；在层级条中选中时，检视器仅显示当前动画层级的选中帧，以便您更轻松地对其进行操作。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:27
msgid "Setting the Default Type of Level to Draw"
msgstr "设置默认要绘制的层级类型"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:28
msgid "It's possible to define the default level type that will be created when you draw inside OpenToonz."
msgstr "可以定义在 OpenToonz 内部绘制时将创建的默认层级类型。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:30
msgid ""
"By default Toonz Vector and Toonz Raster levels are saved in the **+drawing** folder of the current project when the scene is saved, while Raster levels are saved in the **+extras** folder (see  :ref:`Project Default Folders "
"<project_default_folders>`  )."
msgstr "默认情况下，保存场景时，Toonz 矢量和 Toonz 栅格层级保存在当前项目的 **+drawings** 文件夹中，而栅格层级保存在 **+extras** 文件夹中（参见 :ref:`项目默认文件夹 <project_default_folders>`）。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:32
msgid "**To define the Default Type of Level to Draw:**"
msgstr "**定义要绘制的默认层级类型：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:34
msgid "Open File  →  Preferences...  →  Drawing."
msgstr "打开 文件 → 首选项... → 绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:36
msgid "Choose the level type you want to use as default from the **Default Level Type:** option menu. **Width**, **Height** and **DPI** fields are available for **Toonz Raster Level** and **Raster Level** options."
msgstr "从**默认层级类型：**选项菜单中选择要作为默认使用的层级类型。**Toonz 栅格层级**和**栅格层级**选项提供**宽度**、**高度**和**DPI**字段。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:38
msgid "The Width, Height and DPI values set in the File  →  Preferences...  →  Drawing section will also be used as default for the **New Level** dialog."
msgstr "在文件 → 首选项... → 绘图部分设置的宽度、高度和DPI值也将用作**新建层级**对话框的默认值。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:43
msgid "Animation levels can be created in the following ways:"
msgstr "可以通过以下方式创建动画层级："

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:45
msgid "Using the **New Level** dialog."
msgstr "使用**新建层级**对话框。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:47
msgid "Setting the Autocreation option to **Enabled**."
msgstr "将自动创建选项设置为**启用**。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:49
msgid "Setting the Autocreation option to **Use Xsheet as Animation Sheet**."
msgstr "将自动创建选项设置为**使用摄影表作为动画纸**。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:55
msgid "Using the New Level Dialog"
msgstr "使用新建层级对话框"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:56
msgid ""
"New animation levels can be defined by using a dialog that lets you set the number of drawings the level is made of, the animation step used to expose the frames in the Xsheet/Timeline, and the increment, that sets the way the "
"level drawings are numbered. For example, a **Step** 2 repeats each drawing twice in the Xsheet column or Timeline layer, while an **Increment** 2 will number its drawings as 1, 3, 5, etc. The dialog also allows you to choose "
"a destination folder, different from the default one, by using the **Save In** field."
msgstr ""
"可以使用一个对话框定义新的动画层级，该对话框允许您设置构成层级的绘图数量、在摄影表/时间轴中曝光帧所用的动画步长，以及设置层级绘图编号方式的增量。例如，**步长** 2 会在摄影表列或时间轴图层中将每个绘图重复两次，而**增量** 2 会将其"
"绘图编号为 1、3、5 等。该对话框还允许您通过**保存于**字段选择一个与默认文件夹不同的目标文件夹。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:58
msgid "In case you define a Toonz Raster or a Raster level, you can set its **Width**, **Height** and **DPI** values, according to the way you want to use it in the scene."
msgstr "如果您定义的是 Toonz 栅格或栅格层级，可以根据您在场景中的使用方式设置其**宽度**、**高度**和**DPI**值。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:60
msgid ""
"Settings like the length of the level and the numbering order can be edited later, as you are free to arrange the images composing an animation level the way you prefer (see  :ref:`Editing Animation Levels "
"<editing_animation_levels>`  )."
msgstr "层级长度和编号顺序等设置可以稍后编辑，因为您可以自由地按您喜欢的方式排列构成动画层级的图像（参见 :ref:`编辑动画层级 <editing_animation_levels>`）。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:62
msgid ""
"When a new level is created in an empty column, the color of that column header and the cells where the new level gets exposed are colored denoting the type of level: **light yellow** for Toonz Vector levels, **light green** "
"for Toonz Raster levels, and **light blue** for Raster levels (see  :ref:`Working with Xsheet Columns <working_with_xsheet_columns>`  )."
msgstr ""
"在空列中创建新层级时，该列的表头以及新层级曝光所在的单元格会着色以表示层级类型：**浅黄色**表示 Toonz 矢量层级，**浅绿色**表示 Toonz 栅格层级，**浅蓝色**表示栅格层级（参见 :ref:`使用摄影表列 <working_with_xsheet_columns>`）。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:64
msgid "The New Level dialog inherits the **Default Level Type** settings defined in Preferences...  →  Drawing."
msgstr "新建层级对话框继承在首选项... → 绘图中定义的**默认层级类型**设置。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:66
msgid "**To create a new animation level to draw:**"
msgstr "**创建要绘制的新动画层级：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:68 ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:151 ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:169 ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:177
#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:187 ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:295 ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:444 ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:450
#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:456 ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:648 ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:725 ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:869
#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:962 ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:972 ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:980 ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:990
#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1031 ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1039 ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1047 ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1055
#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1115 ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1125 ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1137 ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1147
#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1276 ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1303 ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1396 ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1481
#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1489 ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1497
msgid "Do one of the following:"
msgstr "执行以下任一操作："

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:70
msgid "Select a cell in the Xsheet/Timeline where you want to place your animation level and choose Level → New  →  **New Level...**"
msgstr "在摄影表/时间轴中选择要放置动画层级的单元格，然后选择 层级 → 新建 → **新建层级...**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:72
msgid "Right-click the cell in the Xsheet/Timeline where you want to place your animation level and choose **New Level...** from the menu that opens."
msgstr "右键单击摄影表/时间轴中要放置动画层级的单元格，然后从打开的菜单中选择**新建层级...**。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:74
msgid "(If the Xsheet/Timeline toolbar is visible) Click any of the three **New Level buttons** at the leftmost part of it."
msgstr "（如果摄影表/时间轴工具栏可见）单击其最左侧三个**新建层级按钮**中的任意一个。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:76
msgid "Choose the type of level: Toonz Vector, Toonz Raster or Raster, from the **Type:** option menu and define its settings, then click the OK button."
msgstr "从**类型：**选项菜单中选择层级类型：Toonz 矢量、Toonz 栅格或栅格，并定义其设置，然后单击确定按钮。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:78
msgid "When using the Xsheet/Timeline's toolbar buttons to create a new level, the corresponding level type is already preselected in the dialog's dropdown menu."
msgstr "使用摄影表/时间轴的工具栏按钮创建新层级时，对话框的下拉菜单中已预选了相应的层级类型。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:80
msgid "If a level is already exposed in the cell column, the new level will be created in an empty column."
msgstr "如果单元格列中已曝光了某个层级，则新层级将在空列中创建。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:82
msgid "**To define the saving location for the level you want to draw:**"
msgstr "**定义要绘制的层级的保存位置：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:84
msgid "In the **New Level** dialog type in the **Save In:** field, or use the **Browser button**, to set the path for the saving location."
msgstr "在**新建层级**对话框的**保存于：**字段中输入路径，或使用**浏览按钮**设置保存位置路径。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:86
msgid "If in the browser you choose any project folder, in the path field the full path will be replaced by the correspondent *folder alias* (see  :ref:`Project Default Folders <project_default_folders>`  )."
msgstr "如果在浏览器中选择任何项目文件夹，路径字段中的完整路径将被相应的*文件夹别名*替换（参见 :ref:`项目默认文件夹 <project_default_folders>`）。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:92
msgid "Using the Autocreation Option"
msgstr "使用自动创建选项"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:93
msgid ""
"When in Preferences  →  Drawing the **Autocreation:** option is set to **Enabled**, it is possible to create new drawings automatically by using drawing tools in the viewer. If the currently selected cell is empty, a new level "
"will be automatically created and named with the first available letter of the alphabet; if the currently selected cell is the one **right after** one containing a level drawing (either in the Xsheet/Timeline or the Level "
"Strip) a new drawing will be added to that level."
msgstr ""
"当首选项 → 绘图中的**自动创建：**选项设置为**启用**时，可以通过在检视器中使用绘图工具自动创建新绘图。如果当前选中的单元格为空，将自动创建一个新层级，并以字母表中第一个可用的字母命名；如果当前选中的单元格是**紧接在**包含层级绘图"
"的单元格之后（无论是在摄影表/时间轴还是层级条中），则会将新绘图添加到该层级。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:95 ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:112
msgid "The level type will be the one defined in Preferences...  →  Drawing as **Default Level Type**."
msgstr "层级类型将是首选项... → 绘图中定义为**默认层级类型**的类型。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:101
msgid "Using the Xsheet as Animation Sheet"
msgstr "使用摄影表作为动画纸"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:102
msgid ""
"When in Preferences...  →  Drawing the **Autocreation:** option is set to **Use the Xsheet as Animation Sheet**, it's possible to create new drawings automatically by using drawing tools in the viewer. If the currently "
"selected cell is empty and belongs to an empty column, a new level will be automatically created and named with the first available letter of the alphabet; if the currently selected cell is **anywhere after** one containing a "
"level drawing, a new drawing will be added to that level. In both cases the drawings will take its number from the scene current frame ; if that drawing number already existed in the level, a letter will be added to its number "
"(e.g. A.0001a.ext)."
msgstr ""
"当首选项... → 绘图中的**自动创建：**选项设置为**使用摄影表作为动画纸**时，可以通过在检视器中使用绘图工具自动创建新绘图。如果当前选中的单元格为空且属于空列，将自动创建一个新层级，并以字母表中第一个可用的字母命名；如果当前选中的"
"单元格是包含层级绘图的单元格之后的**任意位置**，则会将新绘图添加到该层级。在这两种情况下，绘图将从场景当前帧获取其编号；如果该绘图编号在层级中已存在，则会在其编号后添加一个字母（例如 A.0001a.ext）。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:104
msgid ""
"This working method allows you to work as a traditional animator: you can start creating the *key drawings*, and then add *breakdown drawings*, and then *inbetween drawings*. You can quickly check your animation flipping it in "
"the viewer."
msgstr "这种工作方式允许您像传统动画师一样工作：可以先创建*关键张*，然后添加*中间张*，再然后是*中间画*。您可以在检视器中快速翻动检查动画。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:106
msgid "When you add a new drawing it will be repeated as a *hold* along the column/layer up to the following one."
msgstr "当您添加新绘图时，它将在列/图层中作为*停顿*重复，直到下一个绘图为止。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:108
msgid "It's also possible to create a new drawing in a cell that contains a *hold*: the new drawing will replace the hold up to the following drawing. Drawings can also be duplicated creating a copy with a different number."
msgstr "也可以在包含*停顿*的单元格中创建新绘图：新绘图将替换停顿，直到下一个绘图。绘图也可以复制，创建具有不同编号的副本。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:110
msgid "Once the animation is completed you can renumber the whole sequence according to the Xsheet/Timeline frame numbering."
msgstr "动画完成后，可以根据摄影表/时间轴的帧编号对整个序列重新编号。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:114
msgid "**To create a new animation level**"
msgstr "**创建新的动画层级**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:116
msgid "Click an empty cell in the Xsheet/Timeline and start drawing using a drawing tool in the viewer."
msgstr "单击摄影表/时间轴中的一个空单元格，然后使用检视器中的绘图工具开始绘制。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:118
msgid "**To add a drawing to an existing level**"
msgstr "**向现有层级添加绘图**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:120
msgid "Click an empty cell in the column/layer containing the existing level and start drawing using a drawing tool in the viewer."
msgstr "单击包含现有层级的列/图层中的一个空单元格，然后使用检视器中的绘图工具开始绘制。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:122
msgid "**To automatically renumber the drawings**"
msgstr "**自动对绘图重新编号**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:124
msgid "Select the cells with the drawings you want to renumber."
msgstr "选择包含要重新编号的绘图的单元格。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:126
msgid "Choose the Cells  →  **Autorenumber** command."
msgstr "选择 单元格 → **自动重新编号**命令。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:128
msgid "The **Autorenumber** command is also available in the menu that opens when right-clicking in a cell."
msgstr "**自动重新编号**命令在右键单击单元格时打开的菜单中也可用。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:134
msgid "Using the Viewer"
msgstr "使用检视器"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:135
msgid "In the viewer, it's possible to use the tools available in the toolbar to draw, paint, edit and model drawings. The work area of the viewer is endless and you can scroll, zoom in, zoom out and rotate it."
msgstr "在检视器中，可以使用工具栏中的工具绘制、上色、编辑和建模绘图。检视器的工作区域是无限制的，可以滚动、放大、缩小和旋转。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:137
msgid "In the title bar you can find information about what is currently displayed and selected, the zoom percentage, and a set of buttons that lets you set the view mode (see  :ref:`Using the Viewer <using_the_viewer>`  )."
msgstr "在标题栏中，可以找到关于当前显示和选中的内容、缩放百分比以及一组用于设置视图模式的按钮的信息（参见 :ref:`使用检视器 <using_the_viewer>`）。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:139
msgid "At the bottom of the viewer another customizable set of buttons is available."
msgstr "检视器底部提供另一组可自定义的按钮。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:141
msgid ""
"The frame bar and the playback buttons let you set the current frame and move through animation frames. The set frame rate is visualized, and, in case the playback is activated, the actual frame rate is displayed on its left."
msgstr "帧栏和播放按钮允许您设置当前帧并在动画帧之间移动。设定的帧速率会显示出来，如果播放被激活，其左侧会显示实际帧速率。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:143
msgid ""
"The other buttons are relevant only using the Animate tool (|animate|) to animate objects and when previewing the animation in the viewer (see :ref:`Animating Objects <animating_objects>` and :ref:`Previewing the Animation "
"<previewing_the_animation>`  )."
msgstr "其他按钮仅在使用动画工具（|animate|）为对象设置动画以及在检视器中预览动画时相关（参见 :ref:`对象动画 <animating_objects>` 和 :ref:`预览动画 <previewing_the_animation>`）。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:145
msgid "If the bottom bar is too short to display all the options, it can be scrolled by using arrow buttons available at its ends."
msgstr "如果底部栏太短无法显示所有选项，可以使用其两端的箭头按钮滚动。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:147
msgid "In case a frame range is defined by playback markers, the playback buttons operate on the defined range only (see  :ref:`Using the Playback Markers <using_the_playback_markers>`  )."
msgstr "如果帧范围由播放标记定义，则播放按钮仅对定义的范围进行操作（参见 :ref:`使用播放标记 <using_the_playback_markers>`）。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:149
msgid "**To navigate the work area:**"
msgstr "**导航工作区域：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:153
msgid "Use the **Zoom** tool (|zoom|): to zoom in, click and drag up; to zoom out, click and drag down. The point where you click is the center of the zooming action."
msgstr "使用**缩放**工具（|zoom|）：要放大，单击并向上拖动；要缩小，单击并向下拖动。单击的点是缩放操作的中心。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:155
msgid "Use the zoom shortcut keys (by default + and - keys) to zoom in and zoom out at specific steps (e.g. 50%, 100%, 200%, etc.)."
msgstr "使用缩放快捷键（默认为 + 和 - 键）以特定步长放大和缩小（例如 50%、100%、200% 等）。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:157
msgid "Use the mouse wheel to zoom in and zoom out."
msgstr "使用鼠标滚轮放大和缩小。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:159
msgid "Middle-click and drag or use the **Hand** tool (|hand|) to scroll in any direction."
msgstr "中键单击并拖动或使用**抓手**工具（|hand|）向任意方向滚动。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:161
msgid "Use the **Rotate** tool (|rotate|) to rotate the viewer: an *horizon line* is displayed to let you understand the amount of rotation; the center of rotation is the absolute center of the work area."
msgstr "使用**旋转**工具（|rotate|）旋转检视器：会显示一条*水平线*以便您了解旋转量；旋转中心是工作区域的绝对中心。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:163
msgid ""
"Use the reset view shortcut (by default the **Alt + 0** key) or right-click in the viewer and select **Reset View** from the menu that opens, to display the viewer at its actual size, centered on the absolute center with no "
"rotation applied."
msgstr "使用重置视图快捷键（默认为**Alt + 0**键）或右键单击检视器并从打开的菜单中选择**重置视图**，以实际大小显示检视器，居中对齐绝对中心且不应用任何旋转。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:165
msgid "Right-click and choose **Fit to Window** to automatically zoom the viewer so that it fits the camera box."
msgstr "右键单击并选择**适应窗口**，自动缩放检视器使其适应摄像机框。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:167
msgid "**To play the scene contents back:**"
msgstr "**回放场景内容：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:171
msgid "Use the **Play** button."
msgstr "使用**播放**按钮。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:173 ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:181
msgid "Drag the frame bar cursor."
msgstr "拖动帧栏光标。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:175
msgid "**To set the current frame:**"
msgstr "**设置当前帧：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:179
msgid "Use the playback buttons."
msgstr "使用播放按钮。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:183
msgid "Type in the **Current Frame** field the number of the frame you want to view."
msgstr "在**当前帧**字段中输入要查看的帧的编号。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:185
msgid "**To set the playback frame rate:**"
msgstr "**设置播放帧速率：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:189
msgid "Enter a value in the **FPS** field."
msgstr "在**FPS**字段中输入一个值。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:191
msgid "Use the frame rate slider."
msgstr "使用帧速率滑块。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:197
msgid "Adjusting the Viewer Visualization"
msgstr "调整检视器可视化"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:198
msgid "The way the viewer visualizes the scene content can be adjusted according to the task to perform."
msgstr "检视器可视化场景内容的方式可以根据要执行的任务进行调整。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:200
msgid "**Full Screen** mode can be entered to maximize the viewer to the monitor screen, hiding any interface window border. This is available only on the Windows platform."
msgstr "可以进入**全屏**模式，将检视器最大化到监视器屏幕，隐藏任何界面窗口边框。此功能仅在 Windows 平台上可用。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:202
msgid ""
"Vector drawings, that can slow down the visualization performance when used in large amounts in a scene, can be visualized as raster drawings, faster to visualize, still preserving their vector nature, by using the **Visualize "
"Vector As Raster** option."
msgstr "矢量绘图在场景中大量使用时可能会降低可视化性能，可以通过使用**将矢量可视化为栅格**选项，将其可视化为栅格绘图，可视化速度更快，同时仍保留其矢量特性。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:204
msgid "If the current level is vector-based, it will still be displayed as vector to allow any drawing/editing operation you may perform."
msgstr "如果当前层级是基于矢量的，它仍将显示为矢量，以允许您执行任何绘图/编辑操作。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:206
msgid ""
"Raster drawings and images that usually are displayed in the viewer according to their DPI value, can be displayed at their actual pixel size, that is to say that one pixel from the image is displayed as one pixel of the "
"screen monitor, to better examine them."
msgstr "通常根据其DPI值在检视器中显示的栅格绘图和图像，可以以其实际像素大小显示，即图像中的一个像素显示为屏幕监视器的一个像素，以便更好地检查它们。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:208
msgid "Visualizing an image at its actual pixel size is different from zooming in because zooming always takes into account the image DPI information."
msgstr "以实际像素大小可视化图像与放大不同，因为放大总是会考虑图像的DPI信息。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:210
msgid "**Windows only - To enter the viewer full screen mode:**"
msgstr "**仅限 Windows - 进入检视器全屏模式：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:212
msgid "Right-click the viewer and choose **Full Screen Mode** from the menu that opens."
msgstr "右键单击检视器，然后从打开的菜单中选择**全屏模式**。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:214
msgid "**Windows only - To exit the viewer full screen mode:**"
msgstr "**仅限 Windows - 退出检视器全屏模式：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:216
msgid "Right-click the viewer and choose **Exit Full Screen Mode** from the menu that opens."
msgstr "右键单击检视器，然后从打开的菜单中选择**退出全屏模式**。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:218
msgid "**To activate or deactivate the raster visualization for vector drawings:**"
msgstr "**激活或停用矢量绘图的栅格可视化：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:220
msgid "Activate or deactivate the View  →  **Visualize Vector As Raster** option."
msgstr "激活或停用 视图 → **将矢量可视化为栅格**选项。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:222
msgid "**To display raster drawings and images at their actual pixel size:**"
msgstr "**以实际像素大小显示栅格绘图和图像：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:224
msgid "In the Xsheet/Timeline select the level to which the drawing or image belongs so that it becomes the current level."
msgstr "在摄影表/时间轴中选择绘图或图像所属的层级，使其成为当前层级。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:226
msgid "Select the drawing or image in the Level Strip in order to display it alone."
msgstr "在层级条中选择绘图或图像，以便单独显示它。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:228
msgid "Use the Actual Pixel Size shortcut (by default the **N** key) or right-click in the viewer and choose **Actual Pixel Size** from the menu that opens."
msgstr "使用实际像素大小快捷键（默认为**N**键）或右键单击检视器并从打开的菜单中选择**实际像素大小**。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:234
msgid "Customizing the Viewer"
msgstr "自定义检视器"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:235
msgid ""
"The Viewer can be customized according to your needs: the background colors visible in the Viewer and inside the camera box can be changed; a Field Guide and a Safe Area can be displayed for reference; the Table and Camera Box "
"can be hidden; Custom Guides can be added to help you in aligning objects or composing the elements of the scene for a particular frame. The View  →  **Inks Only** check allows to hide the painted areas of the levels, "
"facilitating the drawing process."
msgstr ""
"可以根据需要自定义检视器：可以更改检视器中以及摄像机框内可见的背景颜色；可以显示场导和安全区域作为参考；可以隐藏台面和摄像机框；可以添加自定义参考线，以帮助您对齐对象或为特定帧构图场景元素。视图 → **仅墨线**复选框允许隐藏层级的"
"已上色区域，方便绘图过程。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:237
msgid "The set of buttons and information available in the bottom bar of the Viewer can be customized as well, so that only the elements you require are visible."
msgstr "检视器底部栏中的按钮和信息集也可以自定义，以便仅显示您需要的元素。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:239
msgid "**To change the Viewer Background color:**"
msgstr "**更改检视器背景颜色：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:241
msgid "Open the File  →  Preferences...  →  **Colors** dialog."
msgstr "打开 文件 → 首选项... → **颜色**对话框。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:243
msgid "Define the **Viewer BG Color** by doing one of the following:"
msgstr "通过以下任一方式定义**检视器背景颜色**："

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:245
msgid "Set the Red, Green and Blue values."
msgstr "设置红色、绿色和蓝色值。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:247 ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:257
msgid "Click the color thumbnail and use the **Style Editor** to edit it (see  :ref:`Plain Colors <plain_colors>`  )."
msgstr "单击颜色缩略图并使用**样式编辑器**进行编辑（参见 :ref:`纯色 <plain_colors>`）。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:249
msgid "**To change the Camera Box Background color:**"
msgstr "**更改摄像机框背景颜色：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:251 ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:277
msgid "Open the Xsheet  →  **Scene Settings...** dialog."
msgstr "打开 摄影表 → **场景设置...**对话框。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:253
msgid "Define the **Camera BG Color** by doing one of the following:"
msgstr "通过以下任一方式定义**摄像机背景颜色**："

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:255
msgid "Set the Red, Green, Blue and Alpha values."
msgstr "设置红色、绿色、蓝色和 Alpha 值。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:259
msgid "**To show or hide the Table:**"
msgstr "**显示或隐藏台面：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:261
msgid "Choose View  →  **Table** to show or hide the table."
msgstr "选择 视图 → **台面**以显示或隐藏台面。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:263
msgid "**To show or hide the Camera Box:**"
msgstr "**显示或隐藏摄像机框：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:265
msgid "Choose View  →  **Camera Box** to show or hide the camera box."
msgstr "选择 视图 → **摄像机框**以显示或隐藏摄像机框。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:267
msgid "**To show or hide the Camera Background color:**"
msgstr "**显示或隐藏摄像机背景颜色：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:269
msgid "Choose View  →  **Camera BG Color** to show or hide the camera box background color."
msgstr "选择 视图 → **摄像机背景颜色**以显示或隐藏摄像机框背景颜色。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:271
msgid "**To show or hide the Field Guide:**"
msgstr "**显示或隐藏场导：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:273
msgid "Choose View  →  **Field Guide** to show or hide the field guide."
msgstr "选择 视图 → **场导**以显示或隐藏场导。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:275
msgid "**To define the displayed Field Guide:**"
msgstr "**定义显示的场导：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:279
msgid "Define the **Field Guide Size:** and **A/R:**. **Size** is the number of width fields of the field guide (1 field is equal to 1 inch), and the **A/R** is the ratio between the field guide width and height."
msgstr "定义**场导尺寸：**和**宽高比：**。**尺寸**是场导的宽度场数（1 场等于 1 英寸），**宽高比**是场导宽度与高度之间的比率。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:281
msgid "**To show or hide the Safe Area:**"
msgstr "**显示或隐藏安全区域：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:283
msgid "Choose View  →  **Safe Area** to show or hide the safe area."
msgstr "选择 视图 → **安全区域**以显示或隐藏安全区域。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:285
msgid "**To add a Custom Guide:**"
msgstr "**添加自定义参考线：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:287
msgid "Click in the ruler: a click in the horizontal ruler will create a vertical guide, a click in the vertical ruler will create an horizontal guide."
msgstr "在标尺上单击：在水平标尺上单击将创建垂直参考线，在垂直标尺上单击将创建水平参考线。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:289
msgid "**To move a Custom Guide:**"
msgstr "**移动自定义参考线：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:291
msgid "Drag the custom guide marker in the ruler."
msgstr "在标尺中拖动自定义参考线标记。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:293
msgid "**To delete a Custom Guide:**"
msgstr "**删除自定义参考线：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:297
msgid "Right-click on the guide marker in the ruler."
msgstr "右键单击标尺中的参考线标记。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:299
msgid "Drag its marker outside of the Viewer, in the opposite direction of the guide itself."
msgstr "将其标记向参考线本身的反方向拖出检视器。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:301
msgid "**To show or hide Custom Guides:**"
msgstr "**显示或隐藏自定义参考线：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:303
msgid "Choose View  →  **Guides** to show or hide the guides."
msgstr "选择 视图 → **参考线**以显示或隐藏参考线。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:305
msgid "**To show or hide the Rulers where Custom Guide markers are located:**"
msgstr "**显示或隐藏自定义参考线标记所在的标尺：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:307
msgid "Choose View  →  **Rulers** to show or hide the rulers."
msgstr "选择 视图 → **标尺**以显示或隐藏标尺。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:309
msgid ""
"When the Viewer work area is rotated, guides are rotated as well, but rulers and guide markers will preserve their position and orientation. However the position of a guide will still be controlled by markers, even if they "
"visually don’t match anymore."
msgstr "当检视器工作区域旋转时，参考线也会随之旋转，但标尺和参考线标记将保持其位置和方向。然而，参考线的位置仍将由标记控制，即使它们在视觉上不再匹配。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:311
msgid "**To customize the set of buttons in the bottom bar of the viewer:**"
msgstr "**自定义检视器底部栏中的按钮集：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:313
msgid "Click the option button (|option|) on the far left of the bottom area, and select the elements to show, or deselect those to hide, in the menu that opens."
msgstr "单击底部区域最左侧的选项按钮（|option|），然后在打开的菜单中选中要显示的元素，或取消选中要隐藏的元素。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:319
msgid "Drawing Tools"
msgstr "绘图工具"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:320
msgid ""
"You can draw by using the **Brush** (|brush|) and **Geometric** (|geometric|) tools. For both tools you can set the thickness of the line you are going to draw: values range from 0 to 100 for Toonz Vector levels, and from 1 to "
"100 for Toonz Raster and Raster levels."
msgstr "您可以使用**画笔**（|brush|）和**几何体**（|geometric|）工具进行绘制。对于这两种工具，都可以设置要绘制的线条粗细：Toonz 矢量层级的范围是 0 到 100，Toonz 栅格和栅格层级的范围是 1 到 100。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:322
msgid "For Toonz Raster and Raster levels it's possible to set a Brush tool size higher than 100 by typing it in the Size value fields."
msgstr "对于 Toonz 栅格和栅格层级，可以在大小值字段中输入大于 100 的值来设置画笔工具大小。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:324
msgid "**Min** and **Max Size/Thickness** can be modified by either of these methods:"
msgstr "**最小**和**最大大小/粗细**可以通过以下任一方法修改："

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:326
msgid "Pressing **Ctrl + Alt** and moving the mouse. *Moving horizontally* changes the **Max** value, while *moving vertically* changes the **Min** value."
msgstr "按下**Ctrl + Alt**并移动鼠标。*水平移动*改变**最大**值，而*垂直移动*改变**最小**值。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:328
msgid "Using the predefined keyboard shortcuts. **U** and **I** for respectively decreasing and increasing the **Max** value, or **H** and **J** for respectively decreasing and increasing the **Min** value."
msgstr "使用预定义的键盘快捷键。**U**和**I**分别用于减小和增大**最大**值，或**H**和**J**分别用于减小和增大**最小**值。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:330
msgid "With the **Brush** tool (|brush|), you can take full advantage of the pressure sensitivity if you are using a pressure sensitive tablet. The more you press on the tablet, the thicker the line you draw."
msgstr "使用**画笔**工具（|brush|），如果您使用压感数位板，可以充分利用其压感功能。在数位板上按压得越用力，绘制的线条就越粗。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:332
msgid "With the **Geometric** tool (|geometric|), the thickness value is constantly applied to the whole shape you draw."
msgstr "使用**几何体**工具（|geometric|），粗细值会持续应用于您绘制的整个形状。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:334
msgid ""
"When creating vector drawings the size/thickness can also be set to 0 (zero): in this case vector strokes will only exist as a wireframe even if you zoom in or zoom out, and they will be not visible when the animation is "
"rendered."
msgstr "创建矢量绘图时，大小/粗细也可以设置为 0（零）：在这种情况下，矢量笔触将仅作为线框存在，即使您放大或缩小，并且在渲染动画时它们将不可见。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:336
msgid "For vector drawings, line thickness can be changed and tweaked afterwards by using other tools (see  :ref:`Editing Drawings <editing_drawings>`  )."
msgstr "对于矢量绘图，线条粗细可以在之后使用其他工具进行更改和调整（参见 :ref:`编辑绘图 <editing_drawings>`）。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:342
msgid "Drawing with the Brush Tool"
msgstr "使用画笔工具绘制"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:343
msgid "The **Brush** tool (|brush|) allows you to draw freehand lines with the current style."
msgstr "**画笔**工具（|brush|）允许您使用当前样式绘制自由线条。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:345
msgid ""
"When using a pressure sensitive tablet, and the **Pressure** option is activated, varying the pressure of the pen on the tablet will allow you to create variable-thickness lines that will make your drawings more expressive."
msgstr "使用压感数位板且**压力**选项被激活时，改变笔在数位板上的压力可以让您创建粗细变化的线条，使您的绘图更具表现力。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:347
msgid ""
"When using the **Brush** tool (|brush|) on Toonz Raster and Raster drawings, the cursor displays the exact pixel area that will be affected by the brush: the inner jagged circle representing the **Minimum Size**, and the outer "
"one the **Maximum Size** of the brush."
msgstr "在 Toonz 栅格和栅格绘图上使用**画笔**工具（|brush|）时，光标会显示将受画笔影响的确切像素区域：内部的锯齿状圆圈代表画笔的**最小尺寸**，外部的代表**最大尺寸**。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:349 ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:398 ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:485 ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:520
#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:740
msgid "In the tool options bar you can set the following:"
msgstr "在工具选项栏中，您可以设置以下内容："

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:351
msgid ""
"**Size Min** and **Max** sets the size of the brush; the size will vary between the two values if you're using a pressure sensitive tablet. If the two values are the same, your lines will have a constant thickness. When using "
"a mouse to draw, the **Maximum** thickness value will be used."
msgstr "**大小 最小**和**最大**设置画笔的大小；如果您使用压感数位板，大小将在两个值之间变化。如果两个值相同，您的线条将具有恒定的粗细。使用鼠标绘制时，将使用**最大**粗细值。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:353
msgid ""
"**Accuracy** sets how accurate the generated line is compared to what you draw with the mouse or tablet pen: a high value will generate lines that completely preserves the movement you perform (even a trembling hand); a low "
"value will simplify the line. This is available for Toonz Vector drawings only."
msgstr "**精度**设置生成的线条与您用鼠标或数位板笔绘制的线条相比的准确度：高值将生成完全保留您执行动作（即使是手抖）的线条；低值将简化线条。此功能仅适用于 Toonz 矢量绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:355
msgid "**Smooth** allows for stroke stabilization while drawing. This is available for Toonz Vector and Toonz Raster drawings only."
msgstr "**平滑**允许在绘制时稳定笔触。此功能仅适用于 Toonz 矢量和 Toonz 栅格绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:357
msgid "**Hardness** sets the amount of antialiasing along the line border. This is available for Toonz Raster and Raster drawings only."
msgstr "**硬度**设置线条边框的抗锯齿量。此功能仅适用于 Toonz 栅格和栅格绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:359
msgid ""
"**Opacity Min** and **Max** sets the opacity of the brush; the opacity will vary between the two values if you're using a pressure sensitive tablet. Overlapping areas are not considered while drawing a single line, but only "
"when different lines are overlapping. This is available for Raster drawings only."
msgstr "**不透明度 最小**和**最大**设置画笔的不透明度；如果您使用压感数位板，不透明度将在两个值之间变化。绘制单条线时不考虑重叠区域，仅在绘制不同线条重叠时才考虑。此功能仅适用于栅格绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:361
msgid "**Break** automatically breaks the drawn stroke into sections, if very sharp angles are drawn: in this way, drawn shapes may result simpler and easier to fill. This is available for Toonz Vector drawings only."
msgstr "**打断**在绘制非常尖锐的角度时自动将绘制的笔触分成若干段：这样，绘制的形状可能会更简单，更容易填充。此功能仅适用于 Toonz 矢量绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:363
msgid ""
"**Draw Order** allows to choose how new drawings will be ordered with respect to already drawn lines. The options are: **Over All**, **Under All** and **Palette Order**. When using **Palette Order** new lines will be drawn "
"above or below already existing ones, using the relative indexes of the palette Styles as the sorting factor. This is available for Toonz Raster drawings only."
msgstr ""
"**绘制顺序**允许选择新绘图相对于已绘制线条的排序方式。选项有：**在所有之上**、**在所有之下**和**调色板顺序**。使用**调色板顺序**时，新线条将绘制在现有线条之上或之下，使用调色板样式的相对索引作为排序因素。此功能仅适用于 Toonz 栅"
"格绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:365
msgid "**Pencil** mode draws lines without antialiasing, that is with jagged edges. This is available for Toonz Raster drawings only."
msgstr "**铅笔**模式绘制不带抗锯齿的线条，即具有锯齿状边缘。此功能仅适用于 Toonz 栅格绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:367
msgid "**Pressure** detects, in case you are using a graphic tablet, the pressure of the pen on the tablet, allowing the creation of variable-thickness lines."
msgstr "**压力**在您使用绘图板时检测笔在板上的压力，允许创建粗细可变的线条。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:369
msgid ""
"**Range** allows for the automatic creation of a series of in-between strokes, by drawing just the extremes of the animation on subsequent frames of a level, in the Level Strip, or subsequent exposed cells of a level in the "
"Xsheet/Timeline. By pressing **Ctrl** key, you can draw intermediate strokes to form a more complex animation sequence. This method is similar to the one used by the **Inbetween** command (see  :ref:`Using the In-betweener "
"with Vector Drawings <using_the_in-betweener_with_vector_drawings>`  ). This is available for Toonz Vector drawings only."
msgstr ""
"**范围**允许自动创建一系列中间笔触，只需在层级条中层级的后续帧上，或在摄影表/时间轴中层级的后续曝光单元格上绘制动画的极端位置即可。通过按住**Ctrl**键，可以绘制中间笔触以形成更复杂的动画序列。此方法与**中间画**命令使用的方法类似"
"（参见 :ref:`对矢量绘图使用中间画生成器 <using_the_in-betweener_with_vector_drawings>`）。此功能仅适用于 Toonz 矢量绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:371
msgid ""
"**Snap** allows for the snapping of the cursor to other already drawn strokes of the same level, while drawing a new stroke. It has three levels of sensitivity: **Low**, **Med** and **High**. This is available for Toonz Vector "
"drawings only."
msgstr "**吸附**允许在绘制新笔触时将光标吸附到同一层级的其他已绘制笔触。它具有三个敏感度级别：**低**、**中**和**高**。此功能仅适用于 Toonz 矢量绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:373
msgid ""
"**Preset:** let you choose a brush preset in the option menu on the right. You can add or remove a preset clicking the **+** and **-** buttons. A presets list is created *for each level type* and each added preset will be "
"available for next use."
msgstr "**预设：**让您在右侧的选项菜单中选择画笔预设。您可以单击**+**和**-**按钮添加或删除预设。预设列表是*针对每种层级类型*创建的，每个添加的预设都将在下次使用时可用。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:375
msgid ""
"**Cap** option sets the shape of the ends of the stroke you are going to draw. Options are **Butt** for squared ends, **Round** for semicircular ends, and **Projecting** for squared ends extending beyond the end of the line, "
"according to the vector thickness. This is available for Toonz Vector drawings only."
msgstr "**线帽**选项设置您将要绘制的笔触末端的形状。选项有：**平头**用于方形末端，**圆头**用于半圆形末端，**突出**用于根据矢量粗细超出线条末端的方形末端。此功能仅适用于 Toonz 矢量绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:377
msgid ""
"**Join** option sets the shape of the straight corners along the stroke you are going to draw. Options are **Miter** for pointed corners, **Round** for rounded corners, **Bevel** for squared corner. This is available for Toonz "
"Vector drawings only."
msgstr "**连接**选项设置您将要绘制的笔触沿线直角的形状。选项有：**斜接**用于尖角，**圆角**用于圆角，**斜角**用于方角。此功能仅适用于 Toonz 矢量绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:379
msgid ""
"**Miter:** sets the maximum length of a miter join, that is computed multiplying the miter value by the stroke thickness. If the length exceeds the maximum value, the *Miter* join is turned into a *Bevel* join. This is "
"available for Toonz Vector drawings only, and only if the **Join** option is set to miter."
msgstr "**斜接限制：**设置斜接连接的最大长度，该长度通过将斜接值乘以笔触粗细计算得出。如果长度超过最大值，*斜接*连接将转变为*斜角*连接。此功能仅适用于 Toonz 矢量绘图，并且仅在**连接**选项设置为斜接时才可用。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:381 ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:424 ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:540
msgid "If the tool options bar is too short to display all the tool options, it can be scrolled by using arrow buttons available at its ends."
msgstr "如果工具选项栏太短无法显示所有工具选项，可以使用其两端的箭头按钮滚动。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:383
msgid "**To add a new brush preset:**"
msgstr "**添加新画笔预设：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:385
msgid "Click the **+** button on the right of the presets list."
msgstr "单击预设列表右侧的**+**按钮。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:387
msgid "**To remove a new brush preset:**"
msgstr "**移除画笔预设：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:389
msgid "Click the **-** button on the right of the presets list."
msgstr "单击预设列表右侧的**-**按钮。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:395
msgid "Drawing with the Geometric Tool"
msgstr "使用几何体工具绘制"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:396
msgid "The **Geometric** tool (|geometric|) allows you to draw rectangles, circles, ellipses, regular polygons, polylines and arcs."
msgstr "**几何体**工具（|geometric|）允许您绘制矩形、圆形、椭圆形、正多边形、折线和弧线。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:400
msgid "**Thickness** sets the size of the brush used to draw the geometric shapes."
msgstr "**粗细**设置用于绘制几何形状的画笔大小。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:402
msgid "**Hardness** sets the amount of antialiasing along the shape border. This is available for Toonz Raster and Raster drawings only."
msgstr "**硬度**设置形状边框的抗锯齿量。此功能仅适用于 Toonz 栅格和栅格绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:404
msgid "**Opacity** sets the opacity of the shape border. Overlapping areas are not considered while drawing over the same shape, but only when different shapes are overlapping. This is available for Raster drawings only."
msgstr "**不透明度**设置形状边框的不透明度。在同一形状上绘制时不考虑重叠区域，仅在不同形状重叠时才考虑。此功能仅适用于栅格绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:406
msgid ""
"**Shape:** sets the type of shape you want to draw. Available options are: Rectangle, Circle, Ellipse, Line, Polyline, Arc and Polygon. In case you want to draw a **Polygon**, the **Polygon Sides:** lets you set the number of "
"sides."
msgstr "**形状：**设置要绘制的形状类型。可用选项有：矩形、圆形、椭圆形、直线、折线、弧线和多边形。如果要绘制**多边形**，**多边形边数：**允许您设置边数。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:408
msgid ""
"**Auto Group** automatically defines any drawn closed shape (i.e. rectangles, circles, ellipses, polygons and closed polylines) as a group, *thus creating a new layer that is placed in front of the other drawing vectors*, "
"without intersecting them (see  :ref:`Grouping and Ungrouping Vectors <grouping_and_ungrouping_vectors>`  ). This is available for Toonz Vector drawings only."
msgstr ""
"**自动成组**自动将任何绘制的封闭形状（即矩形、圆形、椭圆形、多边形和闭合折线）定义为一个组，*从而创建一个放置在其他绘图矢量前面的新图层*，而不会与它们相交（参见 :ref:`矢量成组和解组 <grouping_and_ungrouping_vectors>`）。此功能"
"仅适用于 Toonz 矢量绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:410
msgid ""
"**Auto Fill** automatically paints the area defined by any drawn closed shape (i.e. rectangles, circles, ellipses, polygons and closed polylines) with the same style used for drawing. This is available for Toonz Vector "
"drawings only."
msgstr "**自动填充**自动使用用于绘制的相同样式填充任何绘制的封闭形状（即矩形、圆形、椭圆形、多边形和闭合折线）定义的区域。此功能仅适用于 Toonz 矢量绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:412
msgid ""
"**Snap** allows for the snapping of the cursor to other already drawn strokes of the same level, while drawing the shape. It has three levels of sensitivity: **Low**, **Med** and **High**. This is available for Toonz Vector "
"drawings only."
msgstr "**吸附**允许在绘制形状时将光标吸附到同一层级的其他已绘制笔触。它具有三个敏感度级别：**低**、**中**和**高**。此功能仅适用于 Toonz 矢量绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:414
msgid "**Selective** allows the drawing operations not to affect already drawn lines. This is available for Toonz Raster drawings only."
msgstr "**选择性**允许绘图操作不影响已绘制的线条。此功能仅适用于 Toonz 栅格绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:416
msgid "**Pencil** mode draws geometric shapes without antialiasing, that is with jagged edges. This is available for Toonz Raster drawings only."
msgstr "**铅笔**模式绘制不带抗锯齿的几何形状，即具有锯齿状边缘。此功能仅适用于 Toonz 栅格绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:418
msgid ""
"**Cap** option sets the shape of the ends of open shapes you are going to draw. Options are **Butt** for squared ends, **Round** for semicircular ends, and **Projecting** for squared ends extending beyond the end of the line, "
"according to the vector thickness. This is available for Toonz Vector drawings only."
msgstr "**线帽**选项设置您将要绘制的开放形状末端的形状。选项有：**平头**用于方形末端，**圆头**用于半圆形末端，**突出**用于根据矢量粗细超出线条末端的方形末端。此功能仅适用于 Toonz 矢量绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:420
msgid ""
"**Join** option sets the shape of the straight corners along the shapes you are going to draw. Options are **Miter** for pointed corners, **Round** for rounded corners, **Bevel** for squared corner. This is available for Toonz "
"Vector drawings only."
msgstr "**连接**选项设置您将要绘制的形状沿线直角的形状。选项有：**斜接**用于尖角，**圆角**用于圆角，**斜角**用于方角。此功能仅适用于 Toonz 矢量绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:422
msgid ""
"**Miter:** sets the maximum length of a miter join, that is computed multiplying the miter value by the stroke thickness. If the length exceeds the maximum value, the *Miter* join is turned into a *Bevel* join. This is "
"available for Toonz Vector levels only, and only if the **Join** option is set to **Miter**."
msgstr "**斜接限制：**设置斜接连接的最大长度，该长度通过将斜接值乘以笔触粗细计算得出。如果长度超过最大值，*斜接*连接将转变为*斜角*连接。此功能仅适用于 Toonz 矢量层级，并且仅在**连接**选项设置为**斜接**时才可用。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:426
msgid ""
"While **Rectangles** and **Ellipses** are defined by a (bounding) box, **Circles** and **Polygons** are defined by a center and radius; **Polylines** can be used to create open or closed shapes by defining a series of lines; "
"**Arcs** let you set the end points of a curve, and then the bend."
msgstr "**矩形**和**椭圆形**由（边界）框定义，而**圆形**和**多边形**由中心和半径定义；**折线**可通过定义一系列线条来创建开放或闭合形状；**弧线**允许您设置曲线的端点，然后是弯曲度。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:428
msgid "**To draw a rectangle or an ellipse:**"
msgstr "**绘制矩形或椭圆形：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:430
msgid ""
"Click to define the upper left corner, drag, and release to define the bottom right corner. If you press the **Shift** key while dragging, the shape will be regular, i.e. a square or a circle; if you press the **Alt** key, "
"shapes will be drawn starting from their center. It's possible to press both keys at the same time."
msgstr "单击定义左上角，拖动并释放定义右下角。如果在拖动时按住**Shift**键，形状将是规则的，即正方形或圆形；如果按住**Alt**键，形状将从其中心开始绘制。可以同时按住这两个键。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:432
msgid "**To draw a circle:**"
msgstr "**绘制圆形：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:434
msgid "Click to define the center, drag and release to define the radius."
msgstr "单击定义中心，拖动并释放定义半径。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:436
msgid "**To draw a polygon:**"
msgstr "**绘制多边形：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:438
msgid "Set the number of sides in the **Polygon Sides:** field."
msgstr "在**多边形边数：**字段中设置边数。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:440
msgid "Click to define the center, drag and release to define the radius of a circle bounding the polygon."
msgstr "单击定义中心，拖动并释放定义包围多边形的圆的半径。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:442
msgid "**To draw a polyline:**"
msgstr "**绘制折线：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:446
msgid "**Click** to define the first point as a corner point."
msgstr "**单击**将第一个点定义为角点。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:448
msgid "**Click and drag** to define the first point as a control point; while dragging you can set the control point handles."
msgstr "**单击并拖动**将第一个点定义为控制点；拖动时可以设置控制点手柄。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:452
msgid "**Click** to define the end point of the line as a corner point. If you press the **Shift** key, you will draw a vertical, horizontal or 45° line."
msgstr "**单击**将线的终点定义为角点。如果按住**Shift**键，将绘制垂直、水平或 45° 线。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:454
msgid "**Click and drag** to define the end point of the line as a control point; while dragging you can set the control point handles."
msgstr "**单击并拖动**将线的终点定义为控制点；拖动时可以设置控制点手柄。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:458
msgid "**Click** or **click and drag** again to define the end point of another line connected to the end point of the previous line."
msgstr "再次**单击**或**单击并拖动**以定义连接到前一条线终点的另一条线的终点。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:460
msgid "**Double click** to define the last point of an open shape."
msgstr "**双击**定义开放形状的最后一个点。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:462
msgid "**Click** or **click and drag** again on the first point you defined to draw a closed shape."
msgstr "在定义的第一个点上再次**单击**或**单击并拖动**以绘制闭合形状。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:464
msgid "Press the **Ctrl** key to add a linear point after a Nonlinear one."
msgstr "按住**Ctrl**键可在非线性点后添加线性点。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:466
msgid "Press the **ESC** key to cancel the creation of the polyline."
msgstr "按**ESC**键取消创建折线。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:468
msgid "**To draw an arc:**"
msgstr "**绘制弧线：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:470
msgid "Click to define the first end point."
msgstr "单击定义第一个端点。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:472
msgid "Click to define the second endpoint."
msgstr "单击定义第二个端点。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:474
msgid "Drag to set the bend, and click to draw the arc."
msgstr "拖动设置弯曲度，然后单击绘制弧线。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:480
msgid "Adding Text"
msgstr "添加文本"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:481
msgid "Text can be added by using the **Type** tool (|type|)."
msgstr "可以使用**文本**工具（|type|）添加文本。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:483
msgid "It is also possible to work with editable and animatable text in OpenToonz through the use of the **Text Iwa** effect. For more information, please see  :ref:`Text Iwa <text_iwa>`  ."
msgstr "也可以通过使用**Text Iwa**效果在 OpenToonz 中处理可编辑和可设置动画的文本。有关更多信息，请参阅 :ref:`Text Iwa <text_iwa>`。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:487
msgid "**Font:** to be used, taken from a list based on the Operating System default fonts folder."
msgstr "**字体：**要使用的字体，从基于操作系统默认字体文件夹的列表中选取。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:489
msgid "**Style:**, for the chosen font."
msgstr "**样式：**用于所选字体。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:491
msgid "**Size:**, for the chosen font."
msgstr "**大小：**用于所选字体。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:493
msgid "Already written text can be resized by using the **Selection** tool (|selection|) (see  :ref:`Editing Drawings <editing_drawings>`  )."
msgstr "已写入的文本可以使用**选择**工具（|selection|）调整大小（参见 :ref:`编辑绘图 <editing_drawings>`）。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:495
msgid "**Vertical Orientation**, lets you place the text vertically, one letter under another, instead of horizontally."
msgstr "**垂直方向**允许您将文本垂直放置，一个字母在另一个字母下方，而不是水平放置。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:497
msgid ""
"The *current* palette Style is applied to the text you type. The palette style can be changed while typing text, thus you can have characters with different styles in the same text editing session (see  :ref:`Editing Styles "
"<editing_styles>`  )."
msgstr "*当前*调色板样式将应用于您键入的文本。可以在键入文本时更改调色板样式，从而在同一文本编辑会话中拥有不同样式的字符（参见 :ref:`编辑样式 <editing_styles>`）。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:499
msgid "For vector levels, as soon as the text is committed, it's converted into vector outlines, and can no longer be edited as text."
msgstr "对于矢量层级，一旦文本被提交，就会转换为矢量轮廓，无法再作为文本进行编辑。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:501
msgid "**To add text:**"
msgstr "**添加文本：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:503
msgid "Select the **Type** tool (|type|) and click in the viewer where you want to start writing."
msgstr "选择**文本**工具（|type|），然后在检视器中要开始书写的位置单击。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:505
msgid "Choose options **Font**, **Style**, **Size** and **Vertical Orientation**. These options can be changed as long as you are in text editing mode."
msgstr "选择**字体**、**样式**、**大小**和**垂直方向**选项。只要处于文本编辑模式，就可以更改这些选项。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:507
msgid "Change the current color Style in the palette, if you want to use more than one style in the same text editing session."
msgstr "如果要在同一文本编辑会话中使用多种样式，请在调色板中更改当前颜色样式。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:509
msgid "Click inside the text editing area to change the text insertion point."
msgstr "在文本编辑区域内单击以更改文本插入点。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:511
msgid "Click outside the text editing area, or select a different tool, to commit the text."
msgstr "在文本编辑区域外单击，或选择其他工具以提交文本。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:517
msgid "Using the Eraser"
msgstr "使用橡皮擦"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:518
msgid "The **Eraser** tool (|eraser|) allows you to partially erase lines, both in vector and raster drawings."
msgstr "**橡皮擦**工具（|eraser|）允许您部分擦除线条，适用于矢量和栅格绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:522
msgid "**Size** sets the eraser size."
msgstr "**大小**设置橡皮擦大小。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:524
msgid "**Hardness** sets the amount of antialiasing along the eraser border. This is available for Toonz Raster and Raster drawings only."
msgstr "**硬度**设置橡皮擦边框的抗锯齿量。此功能仅适用于 Toonz 栅格和栅格绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:526
msgid ""
"**Opacity** set the opacity of the eraser; passing twice on an area is not considered while performing a single erasing operation, but only when performing different erasing operations. This is available for Raster drawings "
"only."
msgstr "**不透明度**设置橡皮擦的不透明度；执行单次擦除操作时不考虑在同一区域擦除两次，仅在执行不同的擦除操作时才考虑。此功能仅适用于栅格绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:528
msgid ""
"**Type:** has the options **Normal**, to use the standard eraser; **Rectangular**, to perform the erasing inside the box you define; **Freehand**, to perform the erasing inside the area you outline by clicking and dragging; "
"and **Polyline**, to perform the erasing inside the area you outline by defining a series of lines. In vector drawings, a stroke is erased only if it is fully included in the area you define."
msgstr ""
"**类型：**选项有**普通**，使用标准橡皮擦；**矩形**，在您定义的框内执行擦除；**自由手绘**，在您通过单击和拖动勾勒出的区域内执行擦除；以及**折线**，通过定义一系列线条在您勾勒出的区域内执行擦除。在矢量绘图中，仅当笔触完全包含在您"
"定义的区域内时才会被擦除。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:530
msgid "**Mode:** has the options **Areas**, to erase only areas, **Lines**, to erase only the drawing outline, and **Lines & Areas**, to perform both the operations. This is available only for Toonz Raster drawings."
msgstr "**模式：**选项有**区域**，仅擦除区域；**线条**，仅擦除绘图轮廓；以及**线条和区域**，执行两种操作。此功能仅适用于 Toonz 栅格绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:532
msgid "**Selective** allows you to erase only lines or areas made with the current style. This is available only for Toonz Vector and Toonz Raster drawings."
msgstr "**选择性**允许您仅擦除使用当前样式制作的线条或区域。此功能仅适用于 Toonz 矢量和 Toonz 栅格绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:534
msgid "**Invert** performs the erasing on the outside of the area defined with the Rectangular, Freehand or Polyline options. In vector drawings, a stroke is erased only if it is fully outside of the area you define."
msgstr "**反选**在由矩形、自由手绘或折线选项定义的区域外部执行擦除。在矢量绘图中，仅当笔触完全在您定义的区域外部时才会被擦除。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:536
msgid "**Frame Range** allows you to perform Rectangular, Freehand and Polyline erasing on a range of frames, by defining an area in the first and then in the last frame of the range."
msgstr "**帧范围**允许您在一系列帧上执行矩形、自由手绘和折线擦除，方法是在范围的第一帧和最后一帧中定义一个区域。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:538
msgid "**Pencil** mode erases lines without antialiasing, that is with jagged edges. This is available for Toonz Raster drawings only."
msgstr "**铅笔**模式擦除不带抗锯齿的线条，即具有锯齿状边缘。此功能仅适用于 Toonz 栅格绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:542
msgid "The **Eraser** tool (|eraser|) can be automatically selected by *using the eraser of the tablet pen*."
msgstr "**橡皮擦**工具（|eraser|）可以通过*使用数位板笔的橡皮擦*自动选择。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:548
msgid "Converting Raster Drawings to Vectors"
msgstr "将栅格绘图转换为矢量"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:549
msgid "Scanned drawings and raster ones, i.e. drawings not based on vectors, can be converted into Toonz Vector levels."
msgstr "扫描的绘图和栅格绘图，即不基于矢量的绘图，可以转换为 Toonz 矢量层级。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:551
msgid "Two main conversion modes are available: **Centerline** and **Outline**. The choice between the two modes depends on which conversion best fits your needs."
msgstr "有两种主要的转换模式：**中心线**和**轮廓线**。两种模式之间的选择取决于哪种转换最适合您的需求。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:553
msgid ""
"In **Centerline** mode a *single vector stroke with a variable thickness* is generated for each line in the drawing. This means that the converted drawing can be edited like vector-based drawings made directly in OpenToonz, "
"for example you can change the bend of a stroke with the **Pinch** (|pinch|) or **Control Point Editor** tools, and the thickness with the **Pump** tool (|pump|)."
msgstr ""
"在**中心线**模式下，绘图中的每条线都会生成*一条粗细可变的矢量笔触*。这意味着转换后的绘图可以像直接在 OpenToonz 中制作的基于矢量的绘图一样进行编辑，例如，您可以使用**捏合**（|pinch|）或**控制点编辑器**工具更改笔触的弯曲度，使用"
"**膨胀**工具（|pump|）更改粗细。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:555
msgid ""
"In **Outline** mode *two vector strokes* are generated to define each line in the drawing, and areas filled with different colors are separated by a stroke. This means that, for example, to change the bend of a line you have "
"to change the bend of the two strokes defining it, and to change the thickness you have to model one or both strokes defining it. *The thickness of all the strokes is set to 0, so that they won’t be visible in the final "
"render*."
msgstr ""
"在**轮廓线**模式下，生成*两条矢量笔触*来定义绘图中的每条线，填充不同颜色的区域由笔触分隔。这意味着，例如，要更改线条的弯曲度，您必须更改定义它的两条笔触的弯曲度；要更改粗细，您必须对定义它的一条或两条笔触进行建模。*所有笔触的粗"
"细都设置为 0，因此它们在最终渲染中将不可见*。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:557
msgid "Parameters that are not considered necessary by the user can be hidden using the **Options** button (|option|) at the bottom right of the **Convert To vector Pop Up**."
msgstr "用户认为不必要的参数可以使用**转换为矢量弹出窗口**右下角的**选项**按钮（|option|）隐藏。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:560
msgid "In **Outline** mode the following settings are available:"
msgstr "在**轮廓线**模式下，提供以下设置："

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:562
msgid "**Accuracy** sets how much the vector strokes will follow the shape of the original drawing lines. High values create more precise strokes, but makes them more complex."
msgstr "**精度**设置矢量笔触在多大程度上遵循原始绘图线条的形状。高值创建更精确的笔触，但也使其更复杂。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:564
msgid "**Despeckling** removes small spots or marks from the converted images. Its value expresses the size in pixels of the maximum area that has to be removed."
msgstr "**去斑点**从转换后的图像中移除小斑点或标记。其值表示要移除的最大区域的像素大小。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:566
msgid "**Preserve Painted Areas**, when activated, includes all the colors in the converted level."
msgstr "**保留已上色区域**激活时，在转换后的层级中包含所有颜色。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:568
msgid "**Adherence** sets how much smooth curves bend toward full corners."
msgstr "**粘附度**设置平滑曲线向完全角点弯曲的程度。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:570
msgid "**Angle** sets the angular threshold below which full corners are inserted in the image"
msgstr "**角度**设置角度阈值，低于该阈值时会在图像中插入完全角点"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:572
msgid "**Curve Radius** sets the measure of a curve's radius below which it is replaced by a smooth corner"
msgstr "**曲线半径**设置曲线半径的度量，低于该值时曲线将被平滑角点替代"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:574
msgid ""
"**Max Colors** defines the maximum number of colors that are considered in the Raster image and used in the vector one. The value has to be set taking care of the real number of colors used in the Raster image. High values "
"increase the time needed for the conversion. This is relevant for Raster levels only."
msgstr "**最大颜色数**定义在栅格图像中考虑并在矢量图像中使用的最大颜色数量。设置该值时必须注意栅格图像中实际使用的颜色数量。高值会增加转换所需的时间。此设置仅与栅格层级相关。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:576
msgid "**Transparent Color** defines the color that has to be set as the transparent background of the resulting vector level. This is relevant for Raster levels only."
msgstr "**透明色**定义必须设置为结果矢量层级透明背景的颜色。此设置仅与栅格层级相关。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:578
msgid ""
"**Tone Threshold** sets the value of the darkest pixels to be taken into account to detect lines to be converted to vector; for low values only the darkest pixels are considered thus resulting in thinner lines; for high values "
"lighter pixels are considered too, thus resulting in thicker lines. This is relevant for Toonz Raster levels only."
msgstr "**色调阈值**设置要考虑的最暗像素值以检测要转换为矢量的线条；低值时仅考虑最暗像素，从而产生较细的线条；高值时也考虑较亮的像素，从而产生较粗的线条。此设置仅与 Toonz 栅格层级相关。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:581
msgid "In **Centerline** mode the following settings are available:"
msgstr "在**中心线**模式下，提供以下设置："

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:583
msgid ""
"**Threshold** sets the value of the darkest pixels to be taken into account to detect lines to be converted to vector strokes; for low values only the darkest pixels are considered thus resulting in thinner strokes; for high "
"values lighter pixels are considered too, thus resulting in thicker strokes. For Toonz Raster levels (TLV files) the process examines only pixels belonging to the lines; for Raster levels it examines pixels of the whole image."
msgstr ""
"**阈值**设置要考虑的最暗像素值以检测要转换为矢量笔触的线条；低值时仅考虑最暗像素，从而产生较细的笔触；高值时也考虑较亮的像素，从而产生较粗的笔触。对于 Toonz 栅格层级（TLV 文件），该过程仅检查属于线条的像素；对于栅格层级，它检查"
"整个图像的像素。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:585
msgid "**Accuracy** sets how much the vector stroke will follow the shape of the original drawing lines. High values create more precise strokes but makes them more complex."
msgstr "**精度**设置矢量笔触在多大程度上遵循原始绘图线条的形状。高值创建更精确的笔触，但也使其更复杂。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:587
msgid "**Despeckling** ignores during the conversion small areas generated by the image noise; the higher the value, the larger the areas ignored."
msgstr "**去斑点**在转换过程中忽略图像噪声生成的小区域；值越高，忽略的区域越大。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:589
msgid ""
"**Max Thickness** sets the maximum vector stroke thickness; if this value is low very thick lines will be converted in two centerline strokes defining the line outline; if this value is high, they will be converted in a single "
"centerline stroke."
msgstr "**最大粗细**设置矢量笔触的最大粗细；如果此值较低，非常粗的线条将转换为定义线条轮廓的两条中心线笔触；如果此值较高，它们将转换为单条中心线笔触。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:591
msgid ""
"**Thickness Calibration Start:** and **End:** calibrates the vector stroke thickness defined according to the **Threshold** value; a low value will reduce the stroke thickness preserving its integrity. A different value "
"inserted in the **Start** / **End** field determines an animation of the thickness along the length of the level."
msgstr "**粗细校准 起始：**和**结束：**校准根据**阈值**值定义的矢量笔触粗细；低值将减少笔触粗细，同时保持其完整性。在**起始**/**结束**字段中输入不同的值将确定沿层级长度的粗细动画。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:593
msgid "**Preserve Painted Areas**, when activated, preserves all painted areas in Toonz Raster levels (TLV files) and all the areas painted with colors different from the line color in Raster levels."
msgstr "**保留已上色区域**激活时，保留 Toonz 栅格层级（TLV 文件）中的所有已上色区域以及栅格层级中所有使用与线条颜色不同的颜色上色的区域。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:595
msgid "**Add Border** adds a vector stroke along the image border in order to detect also areas bleeding off the image edge."
msgstr "**添加边框**沿图像边框添加矢量笔触，以便也检测超出图像边缘的区域。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:597
msgid ""
"**Enhanced ink recognition**, when activated, allows to vectorize Raster images (such as TGA, TIF, PNG etc...) without antialiasing along the lines. An heuristic is used to recognize lines and painted areas creating a PLI "
"level, where the lines are seen as ink and the painted areas as paint."
msgstr "**增强墨水识别**激活时，允许对栅格图像（如 TGA、TIF、PNG 等）进行矢量化，线条不带抗锯齿。使用启发式方法来识别线条和已上色区域，创建 PLI 层级，其中线条被视为墨水，已上色区域被视为颜料。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:599
msgid "It's possible to select the images or the level frames that have to be converted directly in the Xsheet/Timeline."
msgstr "可以直接在摄影表/时间轴中选择要转换的图像或层级帧。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:601
msgid ""
"When a conversion is performed, a new level is created according to the selection you made, and exposed in the Xsheet/Timeline in the next column/layer to that containing the source level. The new file will have the same name "
"of the starting one, but with a PLI extension, and a “v” suffix, and is saved in the **+drawings** default folder."
msgstr "执行转换时，会根据您的选择创建一个新层级，并在摄影表/时间轴中将其曝光在包含源层级的下一列/图层中。新文件将与起始文件同名，但扩展名为 PLI，并带有“v”后缀，并保存在**+drawings**默认文件夹中。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:603
msgid "In case a PLI level with the same name already exists, the name of the new file will be followed by a progressive number."
msgstr "如果已存在同名的 PLI 层级，新文件的名称后将附加一个递增数字。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:605
msgid "**To convert raster drawings into vectors:**"
msgstr "**将栅格绘图转换为矢量：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:607
msgid "Select the level frames to convert in the Xsheet/Timeline."
msgstr "在摄影表/时间轴中选择要转换的层级帧。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:609
msgid "Choose Level → Convert  →  **Convert to Vectors...**"
msgstr "选择 层级 → 转换 → **转换为矢量...**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:611
msgid "In the dialog set parameters for the conversion."
msgstr "在对话框中设置转换参数。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:613
msgid "Click the **Convert** button."
msgstr "单击**转换**按钮。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:619
msgid "Checking the Convert to Vectors Process"
msgstr "检查转换为矢量过程"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:620
msgid ""
"At the bottom of the **Convert-to-Vectors Settings** window a preview area is available to display the drawing selected in the Xsheet/Timeline, as it will be after the conversion according to the defined settings. At the same "
"time it allows you to compare the final result with the original Raster drawing that is displayed on the left side, and to highlight the vector strokes structure by clicking the **Centerlines Check** button (|check|)."
msgstr ""
"在**转换为矢量设置**窗口底部，有一个预览区域，用于显示在摄影表/时间轴中选定的绘图，该绘图将根据定义的设置进行转换后的样子。同时，它允许您将最终结果与左侧显示的原始栅格绘图进行比较，并通过单击**中心线检查**按钮（|check|）高亮显"
"示矢量笔触结构。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:622
msgid "You can activate or deactivate it, resize it or navigate its content."
msgstr "您可以激活或停用它，调整其大小或浏览其内容。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:624
msgid "If you change any parameter in the **Convert-to-Vector Settings**, the previewed drawing automatically updates to display how the changes affect the result."
msgstr "如果更改**转换为矢量设置**中的任何参数，预览的绘图会自动更新以显示更改如何影响结果。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:626
msgid "**To activate the preview area:**"
msgstr "**激活预览区域：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:628
msgid "In the Xsheet/Timeline select the drawing you want to preview."
msgstr "在摄影表/时间轴中选择要预览的绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:630 ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:634
msgid "Click the **Preview** button (|preview|) in the bottom bar of the Convert-to-Vector Settings window."
msgstr "单击转换为矢量设置窗口底部栏中的**预览**按钮（|preview|）。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:632
msgid "**To deactivate the preview area:**"
msgstr "**停用预览区域：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:636
msgid "**To resize the preview area:**"
msgstr "**调整预览区域大小：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:638 ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1093 ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1519 ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1554
msgid "Do any of the following:"
msgstr "执行以下任一操作："

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:640
msgid "Click and drag the horizontal separator."
msgstr "单击并拖动水平分隔条。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:642
msgid "Click and drag the separator toward the window border to hide the preview area."
msgstr "将分隔条向窗口边框拖动以隐藏预览区域。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:644
msgid "Click and drag the separator collapsed to the window border toward the window center to display again the preview area."
msgstr "将已折叠到窗口边框的分隔条向窗口中心拖动以再次显示预览区域。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:646
msgid "**To navigate the preview area:**"
msgstr "**浏览预览区域：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:650
msgid "Use the mouse wheel, or the zoom shortcut keys (by default + and - keys) to zoom in and zoom out."
msgstr "使用鼠标滚轮或缩放快捷键（默认为 + 和 - 键）放大和缩小。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:652
msgid "Middle-click and drag to scroll in any direction."
msgstr "中键单击并拖动以向任意方向滚动。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:654
msgid "Use the reset view shortcut (by default the 0 key) to display preview at its actual size"
msgstr "使用重置视图快捷键（默认为 0 键）以实际大小显示预览"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:656
msgid "**To activate and deactivate the Centerlines Check:**"
msgstr "**激活和停用中心线检查：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:658
msgid "Click the **Centerlines Check** button (|check|) in the bottom bar of the Convert-to-Vector Settings window."
msgstr "单击转换为矢量设置窗口底部栏中的**中心线检查**按钮（|check|）。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:664
msgid "Saving and Loading Convert To Vector Settings"
msgstr "保存和加载转换为矢量设置"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:665
msgid "Convert To Vector settings can be saved as *tnzsettings* files in order to have different settings for each level and to be loaded back and used in a different scene."
msgstr "可以将转换为矢量设置保存为 *tnzsettings* 文件，以便为每个层级拥有不同的设置，并在不同的场景中加载和使用。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:667
msgid "Loaded Convert To Vector settings can also become the default settings for the scene or for the project (see  :ref:`Scene Settings and Project Default Settings <scene_settings_and_project_default_settings>`  )."
msgstr "加载的转换为矢量设置也可以成为场景或项目的默认设置（参见 :ref:`场景设置和项目默认设置 <scene_settings_and_project_default_settings>`）。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:669
msgid "**To save the Convert To Vector settings:**"
msgstr "**保存转换为矢量设置：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:671
msgid "Click the **Save Settings** button (|save|) in the bottom bar of the Convert-to-Vector Settings window."
msgstr "单击转换为矢量设置窗口底部栏中的**保存设置**按钮（|save|）。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:673
msgid "In the browser that opens choose for the *tnzsettings* file a location and a name, and click the **Save** button."
msgstr "在打开的浏览器中为 *tnzsettings* 文件选择位置和名称，然后单击**保存**按钮。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:675
msgid "**To load saved Convert To Vector settings:**"
msgstr "**加载已保存的转换为矢量设置：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:677
msgid "Click the **Load Settings** button (|load|) in the bottom bar of the Convert-to-Vector Settings window."
msgstr "单击转换为矢量设置窗口底部栏中的**加载设置**按钮（|load|）。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:679
msgid "In the browser that opens retrieve the *tnzsettings* file you want to load, and click the **Load** button."
msgstr "在打开的浏览器中找到要加载的 *tnzsettings* 文件，然后单击**加载**按钮。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:681
msgid "**To reset the Convert To Vector settings to the scene default:**"
msgstr "**将转换为矢量设置重置为场景默认值：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:683
msgid "Click the **Reset Settings** button (|reset|) in the bottom bar of the Convert-to-Vector Settings window."
msgstr "单击转换为矢量设置窗口底部栏中的**重置设置**按钮（|reset|）。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:689
msgid "Changing the Canvas Size"
msgstr "更改画布大小"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:690
msgid "It's possible to change the size of Toonz Raster and Raster levels, in order to increase or decrease the area around the images of a level."
msgstr "可以更改 Toonz 栅格和栅格层级的大小，以增加或减少层级图像周围的区域。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:692
msgid "|canvas_size|"
msgstr "|canvas_size|"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:694
msgid ""
"The new size can be set in any unit supported by OpenToonz, by using absolute or relative values. If the canvas is enlarged, some white transparent area is added; if the canvas is reduced, some cropping is applied to the level "
"images."
msgstr "新大小可以使用 OpenToonz 支持的任何单位，通过使用绝对值或相对值来设置。如果画布被放大，则会添加一些白色透明区域；如果画布被缩小，则会对层级图像进行一些裁剪。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:696
msgid "**To change the canvas size:**"
msgstr "**更改画布大小：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:698
msgid "Select the Toonz Raster or Raster level you want to modify in the Xsheet/Timeline."
msgstr "在摄影表/时间轴中选择要修改的 Toonz 栅格或栅格层级。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:700
msgid "Choose Level  →  **Canvas Size...**, the Canvas Size dialog opens."
msgstr "选择 层级 → **画布大小...**，画布大小对话框打开。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:702
msgid ""
"In the dialog set the **Unit** to express the new size of the canvas, and set the **Width** and **Height** of the new canvas; activate the **Relative** option to define the new size by specifying only the size the canvas has "
"to increase or decrease."
msgstr "在对话框中设置**单位**以表示画布的新大小，并设置新画布的**宽度**和**高度**；激活**相对**选项，仅通过指定画布必须增加或减少的大小来定义新大小。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:704
msgid "Use the **Anchor** diagram to decide the position of the current canvas in the new one: the arrows are a reference to see how the new size will increase or decrease the current canvas size."
msgstr "使用**锚点**图决定当前画布在新画布中的位置：箭头是参考，用于查看新大小将如何增加或减少当前画布大小。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:706
msgid "Click the **Resize** button."
msgstr "单击**调整大小**按钮。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:708
msgid "In case the new canvas size is smaller than the current one, a confirmation dialog will open, asking you whether you want to crop the canvas."
msgstr "如果新画布大小小于当前大小，将打开一个确认对话框，询问您是否要裁剪画布。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:714
msgid "Editing Drawings"
msgstr "编辑绘图"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:715
msgid "Toonz Vector, Toonz Raster and Raster levels, can be manipulated in OpenToonz."
msgstr "Toonz 矢量、Toonz 栅格和栅格层级可以在 OpenToonz 中进行操作。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:717
msgid ""
"To edit a drawing, for example to copy a part of it, you have first to select it in the Xsheet/Timeline or in the Level Strip. When selected in the Xsheet/Timeline, the viewer displays the whole scene contents at the current "
"frame, when selected in the Level Strip, the viewer displays the selected frame of the current animation level only, to let you work more easily on it."
msgstr "要编辑绘图，例如复制其中一部分，首先需要在摄影表/时间轴或层级条中选中它。在摄影表/时间轴中选中时，检视器显示当前帧的整个场景内容；在层级条中选中时，检视器仅显示当前动画层级的选定帧，以便您更轻松地对其进行操作。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:719
msgid "Drawings can be also selected directly in the viewer: this allows you to work on the different drawings visible at a certain frame with no need to retrieve them in the Xsheet/Timeline or Level Strip."
msgstr "绘图也可以直接在检视器中选择：这允许您在特定帧可见的不同绘图上工作，而无需在摄影表/时间轴或层级条中查找它们。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:721
msgid "All the editing performed on drawings is not saved until you save the related level, or use the **Save All** command (see  :ref:`Saving Levels <saving_levels>`  )."
msgstr "对绘图执行的所有编辑都不会保存，除非您保存相关层级或使用**全部保存**命令（参见 :ref:`保存层级 <saving_levels>`）。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:723
msgid "**To select the drawing to edit:**"
msgstr "**选择要编辑的绘图：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:727
msgid "Select it in the Xsheet/Timeline or Level Strip."
msgstr "在摄影表/时间轴或层级条中选择它。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:729
msgid "Right-click in the viewer the drawing you want to edit and in the menu that opens choose the **Select** command related to the column containing the drawing you want to edit."
msgstr "在检视器中右键单击要编辑的绘图，然后在打开的菜单中选择与包含要编辑绘图的列相关的**选择**命令。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:731
msgid "The right-click menu first lists all the columns containing overlapping drawings, then the columns and objects that are hierarchically linked to the clicked one."
msgstr "右键菜单首先列出所有包含重叠绘图的列，然后列出在层次结构上链接到所单击列和对象的列和对象。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:737
msgid "Using the Selection Tool"
msgstr "使用选择工具"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:738
msgid "The **Selection** tool (|selection|) allows you to edit, move, rotate, scale and distort a selection in a drawing."
msgstr "**选择**工具（|selection|）允许您在绘图中编辑、移动、旋转、缩放和扭曲选区。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:742
msgid ""
"**Type:** has the options **Rectangular**, to select the area of the box you define by clicking and dragging; **Freehand**, to select the area you outline by clicking and dragging; and **Polyline**, to select the area you "
"outline by defining a series of lines. In vector drawings, a vector stroke is selected only if it is fully included in the area you define."
msgstr "**类型：**选项有**矩形**，通过单击和拖动定义框来选择区域；**自由手绘**，通过单击和拖动勾勒区域来选择；以及**折线**，通过定义一系列线条勾勒区域来选择。在矢量绘图中，仅当矢量笔触完全包含在您定义的区域内时才会被选中。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:744
msgid ""
"**Mode:** has the options **Standard**, to select vectors; **Selected Frames**, to edit all the lines of selected frames at once; **Whole Level**, to transform all of the drawings of the current animation level; **Same "
"Style**, to select at once all of the vectors painted with the same style in the current drawing; **Same Style on Selected Frames**, to select at once all of the vector strokes painted with the same style in the selected "
"frames of the current animation level; **Same Style on Whole Level**, to select at once all of the vector strokes painted with the same style in all the drawings of the current animation level; **Boundary Strokes**, to select "
"all the boundary strokes of the current drawing; **Boundary Strokes on Selected Frames**, to select all the boundary strokes of the selected frames; **Boundary Strokes on Whole Level**, to select all the boundary strokes of "
"the whole level.This is available for Toonz Vector drawings only."
msgstr ""
"**模式：**选项有**标准**，选择矢量；**选定帧**，一次性编辑选定帧的所有线条；**整个层级**，变换当前动画层级的所有绘图；**相同样式**，一次性选择当前绘图中使用相同样式上色的所有矢量；**选定帧上的相同样式**，一次性选择当前动画层级"
"选定帧中使用相同样式上色的所有矢量笔触；**整个层级上的相同样式**，一次性选择当前动画层级所有绘图中使用相同样式上色的所有矢量笔触；**边界笔触**，选择当前绘图的所有边界笔触；**选定帧上的边界笔触**，选择选定帧的所有边界笔触；**整"
"个层级上的边界笔触**，选择整个层级的所有边界笔触。此功能仅适用于 Toonz 矢量绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:746
msgid "**Preserve Thickness** will preserve the original thickness of the drawing vectors while performing resizing operations. This is available for Toonz Vector drawings only."
msgstr "**保留粗细**在执行缩放操作时将保留绘图矢量的原始粗细。此功能仅适用于 Toonz 矢量绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:748
msgid "**Scale H** and **V** set the horizontal and vertical scaling of the current selection."
msgstr "**缩放 H**和**V**设置当前选区的水平和垂直缩放比例。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:750
msgid "**Link** will maintain the proportion of the selection while draging over any of the Scale **H** or **V** letters in the tool options bar."
msgstr "**链接**在工具选项栏中拖动**缩放 H**或**V**字母时将保持选区的比例。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:752
msgid "**Rotation** sets the rotation of the current selection."
msgstr "**旋转**设置当前选区的旋转角度。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:754
msgid "**Position X** and **Y** set a vertical and horizontal offset for the selection."
msgstr "**位置 X**和**Y**为选区设置垂直和水平偏移量。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:756
msgid ""
"**Thickness** sets the thickness of the selected vector strokes. In case the selected strokes have variable thickness, or different thickness values, the highest value is displayed, and any change will affect the other values "
"accordingly. This is available for Toonz Vector drawings only."
msgstr "**粗细**设置所选矢量笔触的粗细。如果所选笔触具有可变粗细或不同的粗细值，则显示最高值，任何更改都会相应地影响其他值。此功能仅适用于 Toonz 矢量绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:758
msgid ""
"**Cap:** sets the shape of the ends of the selected vector strokes. Options are **Butt** for squared ends, **Round** for semicircular ends, and **Projecting** for squared ends extending beyond the end of the line, according to "
"the stroke thickness. This is available for Toonz Vector drawings only."
msgstr "**线帽：**设置所选矢量笔触末端的形状。选项有：**平头**用于方形末端，**圆头**用于半圆形末端，**突出**用于根据笔触粗细超出线条末端的方形末端。此功能仅适用于 Toonz 矢量绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:762
msgid "A butt cap, a round cap and a projecting cap."
msgstr "平头线帽、圆头线帽和突出线帽。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:764
msgid ""
"**Join:** sets the shape of the straight corners along the selected vector strokes. Options are **Miter** for pointed corners, **Round** for rounded corners, **Bevel** for squared corner. This is available for Toonz Vector "
"drawings only."
msgstr "**连接：**设置所选矢量笔触沿线直角的形状。选项有：**斜接**用于尖角，**圆角**用于圆角，**斜角**用于方角。此功能仅适用于 Toonz 矢量绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:768
msgid "Miter joins, round joins and bevel joins."
msgstr "斜接连接、圆角连接和斜角连接。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:770
msgid ""
"**Miter:** sets the maximum length of a *Miter* join, that is computed multiplying the Miter value by the stroke thickness. If the length exceeds the maximum value, the *Miter* join is turned into a *Bevel* join. This is "
"available for Toonz Vector drawings only, and only if the **Join:** option is set to **Miter**."
msgstr "**斜接限制：**设置*斜接*连接的最大长度，该长度通过将斜接值乘以笔触粗细计算得出。如果长度超过最大值，*斜接*连接将转变为*斜角*连接。此功能仅适用于 Toonz 矢量绘图，并且仅在**连接：**选项设置为**斜接**时才可用。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:772
msgid "**Modify Savebox** check box allows you to resize the *Savebox* of a drawing. The drawing part that, because of the editing, falls outside of the savebox will be erased. This is available for Toonz Raster drawings only."
msgstr "**修改保存框**复选框允许您调整绘图*保存框*的大小。由于编辑而落在保存框外部的绘图部分将被擦除。此功能仅适用于 Toonz 栅格绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:774
msgid "The *Savebox* size can be set automatically to the minimum size by activating the Preferences  →  Drawing  →  **Minimize Savebox after Editing** option."
msgstr "可以通过激活首选项 → 绘图 → **编辑后最小化保存框**选项，将*保存框*大小自动设置为最小值。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:776
msgid "**No Antialiasing** when activated, the antialiasing is not applied when the selection is deformed or rotated. This is available on Toonz Raster and Raster drawings only."
msgstr "**无抗锯齿**激活时，在选区变形或旋转时不应用抗锯齿。此功能仅适用于 Toonz 栅格和栅格绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:778
msgid "If the tool options bar is too short to display all the tool options, it can be scrolled by using the arrow buttons available at its ends."
msgstr "如果工具选项栏太短无法显示所有工具选项，可以使用其两端的箭头按钮滚动。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:780
msgid "When a selection is made, it is displayed with a bounding box with handles that allow you to perform the following transformations:"
msgstr "进行选择后，会显示一个带有手柄的边界框，允许您执行以下变换："

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:782
msgid ""
"**Move**, click and drag the inside of the raster selection, or any selected vector of a vector selection, to move it; by pressing the **Shift** key while dragging, the movement will be constrained on the horizontal or "
"vertical direction."
msgstr "**移动**，单击并拖动栅格选区的内部，或矢量选区中的任何选定矢量，以移动它；在拖动时按住**Shift**键，移动将被限制在水平或垂直方向。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:784
msgid "The keyboard arrow keys can be used as well to move the selection one pixel in any direction; if they are used while pressing the **Shift** key, the movement will be in 10 pixels steps."
msgstr "键盘方向键也可用于将选区向任意方向移动一个像素；如果在按住**Shift**键时使用，移动将以 10 像素为步长。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:786
msgid "**Rotate**, click and drag outside any corner handle to rotate the selection."
msgstr "**旋转**，单击并拖动任何角点手柄外部以旋转选区。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:788
msgid "**Scale**, click and drag any corner handle to scale the selection freely; by pressing the **Shift** key while dragging the scaling will be uniform; by pressing the **Alt** key the scaling will be applied from the center."
msgstr "**缩放**，单击并拖动任何角点手柄以自由缩放选区；在拖动时按住**Shift**键，缩放将是均匀的；按住**Alt**键，缩放将从中心应用。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:790
msgid "**Scale in one direction**, click and drag any side handle to scale the selection in one direction; by pressing the **Alt** key the scaling will be applied symmetrically from the center."
msgstr "**单向缩放**，单击并拖动任何边手柄以在一个方向上缩放选区；按住**Alt**键，缩放将从中心对称应用。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:792
msgid "**Center**, click and drag the center handle to change the center of rotation, and the center used when Alt-scaling."
msgstr "**中心**，单击并拖动中心手柄以更改旋转中心，以及 Alt-缩放时使用的中心。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:794
msgid "**Distort**, Ctrl-click (PC) or Cmd-click (Mac) any corner handle to distort the selection, or any side handle to shear it."
msgstr "**扭曲**，Ctrl-单击（PC）或 Cmd-单击（Mac）任何角点手柄以扭曲选区，或任何边手柄以剪切它。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:796
msgid "Ctrl-click (PC) or Cmd-click (Mac) operations are not allowed in **Whole Level** modes (see above)."
msgstr "在**整个层级**模式下不允许 Ctrl-单击（PC）或 Cmd-单击（Mac）操作（见上文）。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:798
msgid "**Thickness**, click the double arrow-head at the bottom right corner of the selection and drag up to increase the thickness of selected lines, down to decrease it. This option is available for Toonz Vector drawings only."
msgstr "**粗细**，单击选区右下角的双箭头并向上拖动以增加选定线条的粗细，向下拖动以减少粗细。此选项仅适用于 Toonz 矢量绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:800
msgid "To apply the transformations you can click outside the selection."
msgstr "要应用变换，可以在选区外单击。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:802
msgid "As you roll over the handles, the cursor changes shape to indicate the operations you may perform."
msgstr "当鼠标悬停在手柄上时，光标会改变形状以指示您可以执行的操作。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:804
msgid ""
"Selections can also be Cut, Copied, Pasted and Deleted by using the relevant command in the Edit menu. Cut or Copy and Paste also work from one drawing to another, or onto a new one. This allows you to copy or move a section "
"of a drawing to another drawing, or split a drawing into several ones."
msgstr "选区也可以使用编辑菜单中的相关命令进行剪切、复制、粘贴和删除。剪切或复制和粘贴也适用于从一个绘图到另一个绘图，或到一个新绘图。这允许您将绘图的一部分复制或移动到另一个绘图，或将一个绘图拆分为多个。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:806
msgid "When a drawing in a Toonz level, or a section of it is pasted to another one, the Styles of the pasted drawing are added to the palette of the target level, unless the same Styles are already available in the palette."
msgstr "当 Toonz 层级中的绘图或其一部分粘贴到另一个层级时，粘贴绘图的样式将添加到目标层级的调色板中，除非调色板中已有相同的样式。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:808
msgid "The selection can also be used to change the Style of vector strokes by choosing it in the palette, or by creating a new Style while selected. See  :ref:`Editing Styles <editing_styles>`  ."
msgstr "选区也可用于通过在选择时在调色板中选择样式或创建新样式来更改矢量笔触的样式。参见 :ref:`编辑样式 <editing_styles>`。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:810
msgid "**To edit the drawing savebox:**"
msgstr "**编辑绘图保存框：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:812
msgid "Activate the **Modify Savebox** option to visualize the savebox around the drawing."
msgstr "激活**修改保存框**选项以可视化绘图周围的保存框。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:814
msgid "Use the handles to resize it."
msgstr "使用手柄调整其大小。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:816
msgid "Deactivate the **Modify Savebox** option to confirm the changes."
msgstr "停用**修改保存框**选项以确认更改。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:818
msgid "**To select and transform an area in a Toonz Raster or Raster level:**"
msgstr "**在 Toonz 栅格或栅格层级中选择并变换区域：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:820
msgid "Select the area by doing one of the following:"
msgstr "通过以下任一方式选择区域："

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:822
msgid "Set the type to **Rectangular** and click and drag to define the box whose area you want to select."
msgstr "将类型设置为**矩形**，然后单击并拖动以定义要选择其区域的框。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:824
msgid "Set the type to **Freehand** and click and drag to outline the area you want to select."
msgstr "将类型设置为**自由手绘**，然后单击并拖动以勾勒要选择的区域。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:826
msgid "Set the type to **Polyline** and click to outline the area you want to select by defining a series of lines."
msgstr "将类型设置为**折线**，然后单击通过定义一系列线条来勾勒要选择的区域。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:828
msgid "Do one of the following to make geometric transformations:"
msgstr "执行以下任一操作进行几何变换："

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:830 ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:858 ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:877
msgid "Operate the handles available along the bounding box."
msgstr "操作边界框上可用的手柄。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:832
msgid "Edit the scale, rotation and position values available in the tool options bar."
msgstr "编辑工具选项栏中可用的缩放、旋转和位置值。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:836
msgid "First define the area you want to select, then use the bounding box to make geometric transformations."
msgstr "首先定义要选择的区域，然后使用边界框进行几何变换。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:838
msgid "**To select and transform vectors in a Toonz Vector level:**"
msgstr "**在 Toonz 矢量层级中选择并变换矢量：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:840
msgid "Select the vectors by doing one of the following:"
msgstr "通过以下任一方式选择矢量："

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:842
msgid "Click a stroke to select it."
msgstr "单击笔触以选中它。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:844
msgid "Shift-click to add a stroke to or remove it from the current selection."
msgstr "Shift-单击以将笔触添加到当前选区或从中移除。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:846
msgid ""
"Set the type to **Rectangular** and **click and drag to the right** to define a box and select all the strokes that are *completely* included in the box; **click and drag to the left** to select all the strokes that are "
"*partially* included in the box."
msgstr "将类型设置为**矩形**，然后**向右单击并拖动**以定义一个框并选择*完全*包含在框中的所有笔触；**向左单击并拖动**以选择*部分*包含在框中的所有笔触。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:848
msgid "Set the type to **Freehand** and click and drag to outline an area and select all the strokes that are completely included in the area."
msgstr "将类型设置为**自由手绘**，然后单击并拖动以勾勒一个区域并选择完全包含在该区域中的所有笔触。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:850
msgid "Set the type to **Polyline** and click to outline an area by defining a series of lines and select all the strokes that are completely included in the area."
msgstr "将类型设置为**折线**，然后单击通过定义一系列线条来勾勒一个区域并选择完全包含在该区域中的所有笔触。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:852
msgid ""
"Set the mode to **Same Style** and click to select automatically all the vectors painted with the same style used for the vector you select in the current drawing, or Shift-click to add them to or remove them from the "
"selection."
msgstr "将模式设置为**相同样式**，然后单击以自动选择当前绘图中使用与所选矢量相同样式上色的所有矢量，或 Shift-单击将它们添加到选区或从中移除。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:854
msgid "When clicking a stroke belonging to a group, the whole group is selected (see  :ref:`Grouping and Ungrouping Vectors <grouping_and_ungrouping_vectors>`  )."
msgstr "单击属于组的笔触时，会选择整个组（参见 :ref:`矢量成组和解组 <grouping_and_ungrouping_vectors>`）。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:856
msgid "Do one of the following to make a geometric transformations:"
msgstr "执行以下任一操作进行几何变换："

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:860 ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:879
msgid "Edit the scale, rotation, position and thickness values available in the tool options bar."
msgstr "编辑工具选项栏中可用的缩放、旋转、位置和粗细值。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:864
msgid "First select the vector strokes you want to transform, then use the bounding box to make geometric transformations."
msgstr "首先选择要变换的矢量笔触，然后使用边界框进行几何变换。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:867
msgid "**To select and transform all the drawings of a Toonz Vector level:**"
msgstr "**选择并变换 Toonz 矢量层级的所有绘图：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:871
msgid "Set the mode to **Whole Level** to automatically select all the strokes in all of the drawings of the current animation level."
msgstr "将模式设置为**整个层级**以自动选择当前动画层级所有绘图中的所有笔触。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:873
msgid ""
"Set the mode to **Same Style on Whole Level** and click to select at once all of the strokes painted with the same style used for the stroke you selected in all of the drawings of the current animation level, or Shift-click to "
"add them to or remove them from the selection."
msgstr "将模式设置为**整个层级上的相同样式**，然后单击以一次性选择当前动画层级所有绘图中使用与所选笔触相同样式上色的所有笔触，或 Shift-单击将它们添加到选区或从中移除。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:875
msgid "Do one of the following to make geometric transformations affecting all of the level drawings:"
msgstr "执行以下任一操作进行影响层级所有绘图的几何变换："

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:881
msgid "When working on the whole level the bounding box displayed in the current level drawing is double-lined."
msgstr "在处理整个层级时，当前层级绘图中显示的边界框是双线的。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:883
msgid "**To paste a selection in another existing drawing:**"
msgstr "**将选区粘贴到另一个现有绘图中：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:885 ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:897
msgid "Make a selection in the current drawing."
msgstr "在当前绘图中进行选择。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:887 ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:899
msgid "Copy/cut it."
msgstr "复制/剪切它。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:889
msgid "Select the other drawing in the Level Strip or in the Xsheet/Timeline."
msgstr "在层级条或摄影表/时间轴中选择另一个绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:891 ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:903 ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:911
msgid "Paste the copied/cut selection."
msgstr "粘贴复制的/剪切的选择。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:893
msgid ""
"Selections from Toonz Raster and Toonz Vector levels can be pasted in any other type of drawing, automatically converting the pasted selection to the appropriate type; selections from standard Raster levels can only be pasted "
