msgstr "来自 Toonz 栅格和 Toonz 矢量层级的选区可以粘贴到任何其他类型的绘图中，自动将粘贴的选区转换为适当的类型；来自标准栅格层级的选区只能粘贴到其他栅格绘图中。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:895
msgid "**To paste a selection in a new drawing:**"
msgstr "**将选区粘贴到新绘图中：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:901
msgid "Select an empty frame in the level strip or an empty cell in the ."
msgstr "在层级条中选择一个空帧或在摄影表/时间轴中选择一个空单元格。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:905
msgid "**To merge several drawings into one drawing:**"
msgstr "**将多个绘图合并为一个绘图：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:907
msgid "Select the area you want to merge and copy/cut it."
msgstr "选择要合并的区域并复制/剪切它。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:909
msgid "Select the drawing you want to paste the selection to."
msgstr "选择要将选区粘贴到的绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:913
msgid "Several raster animation levels can also be merged at once by using the related command (see  :ref:`Merging Animation Levels <merging_animation_levels>`  )."
msgstr "也可以使用相关命令一次性合并多个栅格动画层级（参见 :ref:`合并动画层级 <merging_animation_levels>`）。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:915
msgid "**To split a drawing into several drawings:**"
msgstr "**将一个绘图拆分为多个绘图：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:917
msgid "Select the area you want to use as a new drawing and copy/cut it."
msgstr "选择要用作新绘图的区域并复制/剪切它。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:919
msgid "Select an empty cell in the ."
msgstr "在摄影表/时间轴中选择一个空单元格。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:921
msgid "Paste the copied/cut selection: automatically a new drawing will be created."
msgstr "粘贴复制的/剪切的选择：将自动创建新绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:927
msgid "Grouping and Ungrouping Vectors"
msgstr "矢量成组和解组"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:928
msgid ""
"All the vector strokes of a drawing lie on the same plane, therefore drawing *areas* are outlined by segments defined by strokes intersections. This means that if you draw two intersecting squares, automatically three areas "
"are defined: one belonging only to the first square, one to the second one, and another defined by the intersection."
msgstr "绘图中所有矢量笔触都位于同一平面上，因此绘图*区域*由笔触交叉点定义的线段勾勒。这意味着如果绘制两个相交的正方形，会自动定义三个区域：一个仅属于第一个正方形，一个属于第二个正方形，另一个由相交部分定义。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:932
msgid "Painting a drawing that contains intersecting vector strokes and shapes may be an issue, because all of them lie on the same layer."
msgstr "为包含相交矢量笔触和形状的绘图上色可能会出现问题，因为它们都位于同一图层上。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:934
msgid "To organize strokes you can use the grouping features, that creates a new group entity containing only the strokes you select."
msgstr "要组织笔触，可以使用分组功能，该功能创建一个仅包含您所选笔触的新组实体。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:936
msgid ""
"In the case of two intersecting squares, if you want the two squares to be overlapping instead of intersecting, you can create a group containing the strokes of the first square, and another those of the second square, thus "
"defining two groups whose order can be arranged."
msgstr "对于两个相交的正方形，如果您希望两个正方形重叠而不是相交，可以创建一个包含第一个正方形笔触的组，以及另一个包含第二个正方形笔触的组，从而定义两个可以排列顺序的组。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:938
msgid "It's possible to create as many groups as you want in any drawing; groups can be made of one stroke only as well, for instance a circle, or a line."
msgstr "可以在任何绘图中创建任意数量的组；组也可以仅由一条笔触构成，例如一个圆或一条线。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:942
msgid "First define groups, then set a proper layering order to solve the intersection problems."
msgstr "首先定义组，然后设置适当的图层顺序以解决交叉问题。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:944
msgid ""
"When drawing with the **Geometric** tool (|geometric|), closed shapes (i.e. rectangles, circles, ellipses, polygons and closed polylines) can be defined automatically as a group by activating the **Auto Group** option (see :"
"ref:`Drawing with the Geometric Tool <drawing_with_the_geometric_tool>`  )."
msgstr "使用**几何体**工具（|geometric|）绘制时，可以通过激活**自动成组**选项将封闭形状（即矩形、圆形、椭圆形、多边形和闭合折线）自动定义为组（参见 :ref:`使用几何体工具绘制 <drawing_with_the_geometric_tool>`）。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:946
msgid "When your strokes selection includes one or several groups, the new group will include them as well, preserving them and their original sorting order position in case the group is released."
msgstr "当您的笔触选择包含一个或多个组时，新组也将包含它们，并在组被释放时保留它们及其原始排序顺序位置。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:948
msgid "It's not possible to define a group if the selection includes only some strokes belonging to a group."
msgstr "如果选择仅包含属于某个组的部分笔触，则无法定义组。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:950
msgid ""
"When a group is released, if no other group is defined in the same drawing, all the strokes will lie at the same plane; if other groups are defined, the strokes of the released group will lie on a plane behind, in front of, or "
"between the other groups, according to the original group sorting order position."
msgstr "释放组时，如果同一绘图中未定义其他组，则所有笔触将位于同一平面上；如果定义了其他组，则释放组的笔触将根据原始组排序顺序位置位于其他组后面、前面或之间的平面上。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:952
msgid ""
"It's possible to enter groups to isolate them visually from the rest of the drawing and better understand which strokes are inside and which outside the group. In this way it's also easier to work on the drawing, for instance "
"to fill an area or to change the color of some strokes."
msgstr "可以进入组以在视觉上将其与绘图的其他部分隔离开来，并更好地了解哪些笔触在组内，哪些在组外。这样也更容易处理绘图，例如填充区域或更改某些笔触的颜色。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:954
msgid "As the **Selection** tool (|selection|) considers the group as a whole, if you want to select a stroke belonging to a group, first you have to enter the group, and then select the stroke."
msgstr "由于**选择**工具（|selection|）将组视为一个整体，如果要选择属于组的笔触，首先必须进入组，然后选择笔触。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:956
msgid "As groups define which strokes belong to a certain plane, when using the **Fill** tool (|fill|), only areas defined by strokes within the same group can be filled."
msgstr "由于组定义了哪些笔触属于某个平面，因此使用**填充**工具（|fill|）时，只能填充由同一组内笔触定义的区域。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:958
msgid "**To Define a group:**"
msgstr "**定义组：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:960
msgid "Use the **Selection** tool (|selection|) to select the strokes you want to be in a group."
msgstr "使用**选择**工具（|selection|）选择要放入组中的笔触。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:964
msgid "Choose Edit → Group  →  **Group**."
msgstr "选择 编辑 → 组 → **成组**。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:966
msgid "Right-click on the selection and choose **Group** from the menu that opens."
msgstr "右键单击选区，然后从打开的菜单中选择**成组**。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:968
msgid "**To Release a group:**"
msgstr "**释放组：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:970
msgid "Select the group you want to release."
msgstr "选择要释放的组。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:974
msgid "Choose Edit → Group  →  **Ungroup**."
msgstr "选择 编辑 → 组 → **解组**。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:976
msgid "Right-click on the selection and choose **Ungroup** from the menu that opens."
msgstr "右键单击选区，然后从打开的菜单中选择**解组**。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:978
msgid "**To Enter a group:**"
msgstr "**进入组：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:982
msgid "Select the group, then choose Edit → Group  →  **Enter Group**."
msgstr "选择组，然后选择 编辑 → 组 → **进入组**。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:984
msgid "Right-click the group and choose **Enter Group** from the menu that opens."
msgstr "右键单击组，然后从打开的菜单中选择**进入组**。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:986
msgid "Double-click the group."
msgstr "双击该组。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:988
msgid "**To Exit a group:**"
msgstr "**退出组：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:992
msgid "Choose Edit → Group  →  **Exit Group**."
msgstr "选择 编辑 → 组 → **退出组**。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:994
msgid "Right-click the group and choose **Exit Group** from the menu that opens."
msgstr "右键单击组，然后从打开的菜单中选择**退出组**。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:996
msgid "Double-click outside the group."
msgstr "在组外双击。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:998
msgid "**To Select a group:**"
msgstr "**选择组：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1000
msgid "Choose the **Selection** tool (|selection|) and do any of the following:"
msgstr "选择**选择**工具（|selection|）并执行以下任一操作："

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1002
msgid "Click any stroke belonging to the group."
msgstr "单击属于该组的任何笔触。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1004
msgid "Click and drag to select at least one stroke belonging to the group."
msgstr "单击并拖动以选择至少一条属于该组的笔触。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1006
msgid "Set the type to **Rectangular** and click and drag to define a box and select at least one stroke belonging to the group."
msgstr "将类型设置为**矩形**，然后单击并拖动以定义一个框并选择至少一条属于该组的笔触。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1008
msgid "Set the type to **Freehand** and click and drag to outline an area and select at least one stroke belonging to the group."
msgstr "将类型设置为**自由手绘**，然后单击并拖动以勾勒一个区域并选择至少一条属于该组的笔触。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1010
msgid "Set the type to **Polyline** and click to outline an area by defining a series of lines and select at least one stroke belonging to the group."
msgstr "将类型设置为**折线**，然后单击通过定义一系列线条来勾勒一个区域并选择至少一条属于该组的笔触。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1012
msgid "**To Select a stroke in a group:**"
msgstr "**选择组中的笔触：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1014
msgid "Enter the group."
msgstr "进入该组。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1016
msgid "Click the stroke to select it."
msgstr "单击该笔触以选中它。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1022
msgid "Setting Stroke and Group Sorting Order"
msgstr "设置笔触和组排序顺序"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1023
msgid "For each vector drawing, strokes and groups sorting order can be changed by setting what has to lie in front of, and what behind."
msgstr "对于每个矢量绘图，可以通过设置哪些必须在前，哪些在后来更改笔触和组的排序顺序。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1027
msgid "Select vector strokes, create groups and set their layering order to better manage the drawing."
msgstr "选择矢量笔触，创建组并设置其图层顺序，以更好地管理绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1029
msgid "**To bring the selection to front:**"
msgstr "**将选区置于顶层：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1033
msgid "Choose Edit → Arrange  →  **Bring to Front**."
msgstr "选择 编辑 → 排列 → **置于顶层**。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1035
msgid "Right-click on the selection and choose **Bring to Front** from the menu that opens."
msgstr "右键单击选区，然后从打开的菜单中选择**置于顶层**。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1037
msgid "**To bring the selection one level forward:**"
msgstr "**将选区上移一层：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1041
msgid "Choose Edit → Arrange  →  **Bring Forward**."
msgstr "选择 编辑 → 排列 → **上移一层**。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1043
msgid "Right-click on the selection and choose **Bring Forward** from the menu that opens."
msgstr "右键单击选区，然后从打开的菜单中选择**上移一层**。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1045
msgid "**To send the selection back:**"
msgstr "**将选区置于底层：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1049
msgid "Choose Edit → Arrange  →  **Send Back**."
msgstr "选择 编辑 → 排列 → **置于底层**。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1051
msgid "Right-click on the selection and choose **Send Back** from the menu that opens."
msgstr "右键单击选区，然后从打开的菜单中选择**置于底层**。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1053
msgid "**To send the selection one level backward:**"
msgstr "**将选区下移一层：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1057
msgid "Choose Edit → Arrange  →  **Send Backward**."
msgstr "选择 编辑 → 排列 → **下移一层**。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1059
msgid "Right-click on the selection and choose **Send Backward** from the menu that opens."
msgstr "右键单击选区，然后从打开的菜单中选择**下移一层**。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1065
msgid "Editing Vector Drawings"
msgstr "编辑矢量绘图"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1066
msgid "Vector drawings can be edited in some additional ways by using the set of tools. This allows you for example to better calibrate the bend of a vector, or to change its thickness."
msgstr "矢量绘图可以使用工具集中的一些额外方式进行编辑。例如，这允许您更好地校准矢量的弯曲度，或更改其粗细。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1068
msgid ""
"All these transformations can be also achieved on already painted drawings, because the fill styles used to paint will automatically follow the shape of the areas you modify, working like “liquid” color, flooding an area "
"defined by an outline."
msgstr "所有这些变换也可以在已上色的绘图上实现，因为用于上色的填充样式会自动跟随您修改区域的形状，就像“液体”颜色一样，填充由轮廓定义的区域。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1074
msgid "Editing Vector Control Points"
msgstr "编辑矢量控制点"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1075
msgid "To modify a vector by editing its control points you can use the **Control Point Editor** tool (|cpe|)."
msgstr "要通过编辑其控制点来修改矢量，可以使用**控制点编辑器**工具（|cpe|）。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1077
msgid ""
"Control points have handles whose length and direction define the bend of the vector. With this tool you can select a vector and modify the control point handles, or the bend of a curve defined by control points, and move, add "
"or delete control points."
msgstr "控制点具有手柄，其长度和方向定义了矢量的弯曲度。使用此工具，您可以选择矢量并修改控制点手柄，或由控制点定义的曲线的弯曲度，以及移动、添加或删除控制点。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1079
msgid ""
"Control point handles may be linked, that is to say they share the same direction, or not, creating a cusp in the vector; they can also be collapsed in the control point in order to turn it in a corner point. In case only one "
"handle is collapsed, the point will be corner on one side and smooth on the other. When a section of the vector is defined by two corner points, it will be a straight line."
msgstr ""
"控制点手柄可以链接，即它们共享相同的方向，也可以不链接，从而在矢量中创建一个尖点；它们也可以折叠到控制点中，以将其转变为角点。如果仅折叠一个手柄，则该点将一侧为角点，另一侧为平滑点。当矢量的一段由两个角点定义时，它将是一条直"
"线。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1081
msgid "The option Auto Select Drawing is available to automatically select any vector of any drawing visible in the viewer."
msgstr "提供自动选择绘图选项，可自动选择检视器中任何可见绘图的任何矢量。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1085
msgid "Click to select a vector stroke and edit its control points; Alt-click to unlink control point handles; Ctrl-click (PC) or Cmd-click (Mac) the selected stroke to add a control point."
msgstr "单击以选择矢量笔触并编辑其控制点；Alt-单击以取消链接控制点手柄；Ctrl-单击（PC）或 Cmd-单击（Mac）选定的笔触以添加控制点。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1087
msgid "**To select a vector:**"
msgstr "**选择矢量：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1089
msgid "Click it."
msgstr "单击它。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1091
msgid "**To edit the bend of a vector:**"
msgstr "**编辑矢量的弯曲度：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1095
msgid "Click and drag the ends of the control point handles."
msgstr "单击并拖动控制点手柄的末端。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1097
msgid "Click and drag the curve defined by the control points to edit it."
msgstr "单击并拖动由控制点定义的曲线以进行编辑。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1099
msgid "Shift-click and drag the curve defined by the control point to edit it by keeping the control points position fixed."
msgstr "Shift-单击并拖动由控制点定义的曲线，通过保持控制点位置固定来编辑它。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1101
msgid "**To unlink the control point handles:**"
msgstr "**取消链接控制点手柄：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1103
msgid "Alt-click one of the handle ends and drag."
msgstr "Alt-单击其中一个手柄末端并拖动。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1105
msgid "**To link the control point handles:**"
msgstr "**链接控制点手柄：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1107
msgid "Alt-click one of the handle ends and drag: the other handle snaps to the direction of the one you are dragging."
msgstr "Alt-单击其中一个手柄末端并拖动：另一个手柄将吸附到您拖动手柄的方向。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1109
msgid "**To add a control point:**"
msgstr "**添加控制点：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1111
msgid "Ctrl-click (Pc) or Cmd-click (Mac) the vector where you want to add a control point."
msgstr "Ctrl-单击（PC）或 Cmd-单击（Mac）要添加控制点的矢量位置。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1113
msgid "**To select control points:**"
msgstr "**选择控制点：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1117
msgid "Click a control point to select it."
msgstr "单击控制点以选中它。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1119
msgid "Ctrl-click (Pc) or Cmd-click (Mac) a control point to add it to the selection."
msgstr "Ctrl-单击（PC）或 Cmd-单击（Mac）控制点以将其添加到选择中。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1121
msgid "Click and drag to select all of the control points that are included in the selection area."
msgstr "单击并拖动以选择包含在选区内的所有控制点。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1123
msgid "**To move the selection:**"
msgstr "**移动选择：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1127
msgid "Click any selected control point and drag."
msgstr "单击任何选定的控制点并拖动。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1129
msgid "Use the Arrow keys to move the selection one pixel right, left, up or down."
msgstr "使用方向键将选择向右、左、上或下移动一个像素。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1131
msgid "**To delete the selection:**"
msgstr "**删除选择：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1133
msgid "Choose Edit  →  Delete."
msgstr "选择 编辑 → 删除。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1135
msgid "**To turn a control point into a corner point:**"
msgstr "**将控制点转变为角点：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1139
msgid "Alt-click the control point."
msgstr "Alt-单击该控制点。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1141
msgid "Move the handle ends to the control point, in order to collapse them."
msgstr "将手柄末端移动到控制点，以折叠它们。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1143
msgid "Right-click the control point and choose **Set Linear Control Point** from the menu that opens."
msgstr "右键单击控制点，然后从打开的菜单中选择**设置线性控制点**。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1145
msgid "**To retrieve handles from a corner point:**"
msgstr "**从角点恢复手柄：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1149
msgid "Alt-click the corner point."
msgstr "Alt-单击该角点。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1151
msgid "Right-click the control point and choose **Set Nonlinear Control Point** from the menu that opens."
msgstr "右键单击控制点，然后从打开的菜单中选择**设置非线性控制点**。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1157
msgid "Changing the Bend of Vector Strokes"
msgstr "更改矢量笔触的弯曲度"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1158
msgid "To modify a bend of a vector stroke in a more intuitive way you can use the **Pinch** tool (|pinch|). You can use it anywhere you want on the stroke, in order to modify the bend in any direction."
msgstr "要以更直观的方式修改矢量笔触的弯曲度，可以使用**捏合**工具（|pinch|）。可以在笔触上任意位置使用它，以向任意方向修改弯曲度。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1160
msgid "When the tool is selected, a segment of the center line of the closest stroke is highlighted: the segment shows the length of the stroke that will be affected by the pinching."
msgstr "选择工具后，最近笔触中心线的一段会高亮显示：该段显示了将受捏合影响的笔触长度。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1162
msgid ""
"The length of the segment depends on the corner points, that the tool automatically detects along the stroke, according to the **Corner** value. It can also be manually set by activating the **Manual** option, and thus using "
"the **Size** value to set the affected length."
msgstr "该段的长度取决于角点，工具会根据**角点**值沿笔触自动检测角点。也可以通过激活**手动**选项来手动设置，从而使用**大小**值设置受影响的长度。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1164
msgid ""
"When the **Manual** mode is activated, a handle is displayed along the highlighted stroke to control interactively the length of the segment that will be affected by the tool. The handle has a double circle and a square at its "
"ends, that allows you to do the following:"
msgstr "激活**手动**模式时，会沿高亮笔触显示一个手柄，以交互方式控制将受工具影响的段长度。手柄两端有一个双圆圈和一个方块，允许您执行以下操作："

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1166
msgid "**Double circle** lets you move the handle along the segment."
msgstr "**双圆圈**允许您沿段移动手柄。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1168
msgid "**Square** lets you increase the length of the segment affected by the tool by *clicking and dragging right*, or decrease it by *clicking and dragging left*."
msgstr "**方块**允许您通过*向右单击并拖动*来增加受工具影响的段长度，或通过*向左单击并拖动*来减少长度。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1170
msgid "In both Automatic and Manual modes, different types of editing can be performed when clicking and moving the cursor:"
msgstr "在自动和手动模式下，单击和移动光标时可以执行不同类型的编辑："

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1172
msgid "**Click** and drag to change the bend of the highlighted segment."
msgstr "**单击**并拖动以更改高亮段的弯曲度。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1174
msgid "**Shift-click** and drag to edit the highlighted segment by adding a *cusp*."
msgstr "**Shift-单击**并拖动，通过添加*尖点*来编辑高亮段。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1176
msgid "**Ctrl-click** (Pc) or **Cmd-click** (Mac) and drag to edit the highlighted segment by adding a *corner*."
msgstr "**Ctrl-单击**（PC）或**Cmd-单击**（Mac）并拖动，通过添加*角点*来编辑高亮段。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1178
msgid "**To modify the bend of a stroke:**"
msgstr "**修改笔触的弯曲度：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1180
msgid "Change the length of the segment affected by the tool by setting the **Corner** value in the tool options bar."
msgstr "通过在工具选项栏中设置**角点**值来更改受工具影响的段长度。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1182
msgid "Click, Shift-click, or Ctrl-click (Pc) or Cmd-click (Mac) and drag to modify the bend of the highlighted segment."
msgstr "单击、Shift-单击或 Ctrl-单击（PC）或 Cmd-单击（Mac）并拖动以修改高亮段的弯曲度。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1186
msgid "Click and drag to change the bend; Shift-click to add a cusp; Ctrl-click (PC) or Cmd-click (Mac) to add a corner."
msgstr "单击并拖动以更改弯曲度；Shift-单击以添加尖点；Ctrl-单击（PC）或 Cmd-单击（Mac）以添加角点。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1188
msgid "**To modify the bend of a stroke in manual mode:**"
msgstr "**在手动模式下修改笔触的弯曲度：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1190
msgid "Activate the **Manual** option in the tool options bar."
msgstr "激活工具选项栏中的**手动**选项。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1192
msgid "Change the length of the segment affected by the tool by doing one of the following:"
msgstr "通过以下任一方式更改受工具影响的段长度："

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1194
msgid "Set the **Size** value in the tool options bar."
msgstr "在工具选项栏中设置**大小**值。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1196
msgid "Click and drag the small square at one end of the handle displayed along the highlighted stroke."
msgstr "单击并拖动沿高亮笔触显示的手柄一端的小方块。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1198
msgid "Click, Shift-click, or Ctrl-click (PC) or Cmd-click (Mac) and drag to modify the bend of the highlighted segment."
msgstr "单击、Shift-单击或 Ctrl-单击（PC）或 Cmd-单击（Mac）并拖动以修改高亮段的弯曲度。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1200
msgid "**To eliminate a corner point from a segment:**"
msgstr "**从段中消除角点：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1202
msgid "Click and drag the point until the smooth segment is formed again."
msgstr "单击并拖动该点，直到再次形成平滑段。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1204
msgid "Click and drag to correct the bend of the newly smoothed segment."
msgstr "单击并拖动以校正新平滑段的弯曲度。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1210
msgid "Using Other Modifier Tools"
msgstr "使用其他修改工具"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1211
msgid ""
"To modify the thickness of a stroke you can use the **Pump** tool (|pump|). You can use it anywhere you want on the stroke to increase or decrease the thickness locally. When the tool is selected, a segment of the closest "
"stroke is highlighted: the segment shows the length of the stroke that will be affected by the tool. To modify this length you can change the **Size** value in the tool options bar."
msgstr "要修改笔触的粗细，可以使用**膨胀**工具（|pump|）。可以在笔触上任意位置使用它，以局部增加或减少粗细。选择工具后，最近笔触的一段会高亮显示：该段显示了将受工具影响的笔触长度。要修改此长度，可以更改工具选项栏中的**大小**值。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1213
msgid ""
"It's possible to modify the thickness of a stroke, a stroke selection, or strokes in all of the level drawings, by using the **Selection** tool (|selection|) and its related options (see :ref:`Using the Selection Tool "
"<using_the_selection_tool>`  )."
msgstr "可以使用**选择**工具（|selection|）及其相关选项来修改笔触的粗细、笔触选择或层级所有绘图中的笔触粗细（参见 :ref:`使用选择工具 <using_the_selection_tool>`）。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1215
msgid ""
"To distort more than one stroke at once, you can use the **Magnet** tool (|magnet|). The tool affects all stroke included in a circular area and allows you to distort them in the direction of your dragging. Highlighted "
"segments will show the strokes that will be affected. To modify the action range of the tool, represented by a circle, you can change the tool size in the tool options bar."
msgstr "要同时扭曲多个笔触，可以使用**磁力**工具（|magnet|）。该工具影响圆形区域内包含的所有笔触，并允许您沿拖动方向扭曲它们。高亮段将显示将受影响的笔触。要修改工具的作用范围（以圆形表示），可以更改工具选项栏中的工具大小。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1217
msgid ""
"To bend a part of a drawing, for example a character’s arm, you can use the **Bender** tool (|bender|). The tool allows you to define a line and then bend all the strokes intersected by the segment. While bending you can see "
"the affected strokes assuming their position after the transformation. The bending can be performed in both clockwise and counterclockwise direction; once you start dragging you cannot change the bend direction."
msgstr ""
"要弯曲绘图的一部分，例如角色的手臂，可以使用**弯曲器**工具（|bender|）。该工具允许您定义一条线，然后弯曲与该段相交的所有笔触。弯曲时，可以看到受影响的笔触在变换后所处的位置。弯曲可以按顺时针和逆时针方向进行；一旦开始拖动，就无"
"法更改弯曲方向。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1219
msgid "If you move the cursor far from the bending center, you will be able to set with more precision the amount of bend you want to apply to the strokes."
msgstr "如果将光标远离弯曲中心移动，将能够更精确地设置要应用于笔触的弯曲量。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1221
msgid ""
"To smooth a stroke, you can use the **Iron** tool (|iron|). When used again and again on the same stroke, it increasingly flatten the bends of the stroke. When the tool is selected, the cursor snaps to the closest stroke to "
"indicate where you are going to operate."
msgstr "要平滑笔触，可以使用**熨斗**工具（|iron|）。在同一笔触上反复使用时，它会逐渐压平笔触的弯曲处。选择工具后，光标会吸附到最近的笔触，以指示将在哪里操作。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1223
msgid "**To modify the thickness of a stroke:**"
msgstr "**修改笔触的粗细：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1225
msgid "Select the **Pump** tool (|pump|)."
msgstr "选择**膨胀**工具（|pump|）。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1227
msgid "Set the **Size:** value in the tool options bar."
msgstr "在工具选项栏中设置**大小：**值。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1229
msgid "Click the point of the stroke where you want to modify the thickness and drag up to increase it, or down to decrease it."
msgstr "单击要修改粗细的笔触点，然后向上拖动以增加粗细，或向下拖动以减少粗细。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1233
msgid "Using the Pump tool to change the thickness of drawn strokes."
msgstr "使用膨胀工具更改绘制笔触的粗细。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1235
msgid "**To distort several strokes at once:**"
msgstr "**同时扭曲多个笔触：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1237
msgid "Select the **Magnet** tool (|magnet|)."
msgstr "选择**磁力**工具（|magnet|）。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1239
msgid "Click in the Viewer: all the strokes included in the circle will be affected by the tool."
msgstr "在检视器中单击：圆圈内包含的所有笔触都将受工具影响。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1241
msgid "Drag to distort the strokes in the direction of your dragging."
msgstr "拖动以沿拖动方向扭曲笔触。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1243
msgid "**To bend one or several strokes:**"
msgstr "**弯曲一个或多个笔触：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1245
msgid "Select the **Bender** tool (|bender|)."
msgstr "选择**弯曲器**工具（|bender|）。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1247
msgid "Click on one side of the strokes you want to bend to set the center of the bend."
msgstr "单击要弯曲笔触的一侧以设置弯曲中心。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1249
msgid "Click on the opposite side of the strokes: all strokes intersected by the defined line will be affected by the bending."
msgstr "单击笔触的另一侧：与定义直线相交的所有笔触都将受弯曲影响。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1251
msgid "Drag in the direction you want to bend strokes."
msgstr "向要弯曲笔触的方向拖动。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1253
msgid "**To smooth a stroke:**"
msgstr "**平滑笔触：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1255
msgid "Select the **Iron** tool (|iron|)."
msgstr "选择**熨斗**工具（|iron|）。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1257
msgid "Click and drag along the stroke you want to smooth. By dragging over and over the stroke will increasingly flatten."
msgstr "沿要平滑的笔触单击并拖动。反复拖动，笔触会逐渐变平。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1263
msgid "Joining and Splitting"
msgstr "连接与拆分"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1264
msgid "To join the ends of two different vector strokes, you can use the **Tape** tool (|tape|). This way it will be possible to handle them as a single stroke, for instance for modifying their bend, or thickness, as a whole."
msgstr "要连接两个不同矢量笔触的端点，可以使用**胶带**工具（|tape|）。这样可以将它们作为单个笔触处理，例如整体修改其弯曲度或粗细。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1266
msgid "When the tool is used, the pointer snaps to the closest detected stroke endpoint in order to make the operation easier."
msgstr "使用该工具时，指针会吸附到检测到的最近笔触端点，以便操作更简便。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1268
msgid "The **Tape** tool (|tape|) can also be used to close gaps along the drawing outline for painting purposes (see :ref:`Closing Gaps in Drawing Outline <closing_gaps_in_drawing_outline>`  )."
msgstr "**胶带**工具（|tape|）也可用于闭合绘图轮廓中的间隙以便上色（参见 :ref:`闭合绘图轮廓中的间隙 <closing_gaps_in_drawing_outline>`）。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1270
msgid "To do the contrary, that is to say splitting a stroke in two sections, you can use the **Cutter** tool (|cutter|)."
msgstr "相反地，即要将笔触拆分为两段，可以使用**切割器**工具（|cutter|）。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1272
msgid "**To join two open ends of one or two strokes:**"
msgstr "**连接一个或两个笔触的两个开放端点：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1274
msgid "Select the **Tape** tool (|tape|), and activate the **Join Vectors** option; activate also the **Smooth** option if you want a smooth joining with no corners."
msgstr "选择**胶带**工具（|tape|），并激活**连接矢量**选项；如果需要平滑连接且无角点，也激活**平滑**选项。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1278
msgid "Set the type to **Normal** and the mode to **Endpoint to Endpoint**, click a stroke endpoint and drag to a different endpoint; the pointer snaps to the closest detected stroke endpoint."
msgstr "将类型设置为**普通**，模式设置为**端点到端点**，单击一个笔触端点并拖动到另一个端点；指针会吸附到检测到的最近笔触端点。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1280
msgid "Set the type to **Rectangular**, and click and drag to define a box including the endpoints you want to connect; the endpoints will be automatically joined according to the set **Distance** value."
msgstr "将类型设置为**矩形**，然后单击并拖动以定义一个包含要连接端点的框；端点将根据设置的**距离**值自动连接。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1282
msgid "If the strokes you are going to join have different Styles, the Style of the first vector where you click on will be assigned to the second one after joining."
msgstr "如果要连接的笔触具有不同的样式，则单击的第一个矢量的样式将在连接后分配给第二个矢量。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1284
msgid "**To split a stroke:**"
msgstr "**拆分笔触：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1286
msgid "Select the **Cutter** tool (|cutter|): the pointer snaps to the closest stroke indicating, with a small highlighted segment, the point where you are going to split the stroke."
msgstr "选择**切割器**工具（|cutter|）：指针会吸附到最近的笔触，并用一个小高亮段指示您将拆分笔触的位置。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1288
msgid "Click to split the stroke at the highlighted point."
msgstr "单击以在高亮点拆分笔触。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1294
msgid "Cleaning up Strokes Intersections"
msgstr "清理笔触交叉点"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1295
msgid "Vector strokes intersections may be a weak point in drawings to be painted, because if a gap occurs, drawing areas cannot be painted properly."
msgstr "矢量笔触交叉点可能是待上色绘图中的一个薄弱点，因为如果出现间隙，绘图区域就无法正确上色。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1297
msgid "The best solution for this kind of issue is to overlap the final section of strokes, in order to define clear intersections, then automatically remove the sections that overflow."
msgstr "此类问题的最佳解决方案是重叠笔触的末端部分，以定义清晰的交叉点，然后自动移除溢出的部分。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1299
msgid "**To cleanup vector intersections:**"
msgstr "**清理矢量交叉点：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1301
msgid "Use the **Selection** tool (|selection|) to select the strokes whose intersections you want to cleanup."
msgstr "使用**选择**工具（|selection|）选择要清理其交叉点的笔触。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1305
msgid "Choose Level → Optimize  →  **Remove Vector Overflow**."
msgstr "选择 层级 → 优化 → **移除矢量溢出**。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1307
msgid "Right-click the selection and choose **Remove Vector Overflow** from the menu that opens."
msgstr "右键单击选择，然后从打开的菜单中选择**移除矢量溢出**。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1313
msgid "Animation Techniques"
msgstr "动画技术"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1314
msgid "Besides drawing frame by frame, one image at a time, until you achieve the animation you want, some other techniques are easier to achieve thanks to OpenToonz features."
msgstr "除了逐帧绘制，一次一张图像，直到获得想要的动画之外，由于 OpenToonz 的功能，其他一些技术也更容易实现。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1316
msgid "Whatever the technique is, you can control your work and how smooth the animation is by using the onion skin, that allows you to view more than one image in the viewer at the same time as reference."
msgstr "无论采用何种技术，都可以使用洋葱皮来控制工作并检查动画的流畅度，它允许您在检视器中同时查看多个图像作为参考。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1322
msgid "Modelling a Vector Drawing"
msgstr "建模矢量绘图"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1323
msgid ""
"Instead of animating a level by starting every time from a blank frame, you can duplicate a vector drawing and make subsequent modifications. You can do it even if the drawings are painted, because the styles used to paint "
"will automatically follow the shape of the areas you modify (see  :ref:`Editing Drawings <editing_drawings>`  )."
msgstr "与其每次从空白帧开始为层级制作动画，不如复制矢量绘图并进行后续修改。即使绘图已上色也可以这样做，因为用于上色的样式会自动跟随您修改区域的形状（参见 :ref:`编辑绘图 <editing_drawings>`）。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1325
msgid "The sequence of the animation level drawings can be easily controlled in the Level Strip."
msgstr "动画层级绘图的序列可以在层级条中轻松控制。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1327
msgid "You can use both the Cells  →  **Duplicate Drawing** command and the standard **Copy** and **Paste** commands to make a copy of a drawing that you can later modify to create slight movements."
msgstr "可以使用单元格 → **复制绘图**命令以及标准的**复制**和**粘贴**命令来复制绘图，稍后可以修改它来创建微小的运动。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1329
msgid ""
"When you use the **Duplicate Drawing** command, the selected drawing is duplicated in the following frame. If the following frame already contains a drawing, it's shifted down in order to insert the duplicated drawing in the "
"sequence."
msgstr "使用**复制绘图**命令时，所选绘图将在下一帧复制。如果下一帧已包含绘图，则会将其下移，以便在序列中插入复制的绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1331
msgid "When you use the **Copy** and **Paste** commands, you can also decide the frame of the Level Strip where you want to paste the drawing."
msgstr "使用**复制**和**粘贴**命令时，还可以决定要在层级条的哪一帧粘贴绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1333
msgid "Once finished, you can make a copy of the modified drawing, and modify it in its turn. You can go on duplicating and modifying drawings until you complete the animation level."
msgstr "完成后，可以复制修改后的绘图，并对其进行进一步修改。可以继续复制和修改绘图，直到完成动画层级。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1335
msgid "**To create an animation level by modelling vector drawings:**"
msgstr "**通过建模矢量绘图创建动画层级：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1337
msgid "In the Viewer, select a drawing of the vector animation level you want to edit."
msgstr "在检视器中，选择要编辑的矢量动画层级的绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1339
msgid "In the Level Strip, select the drawing you want to duplicate."
msgstr "在层级条中，选择要复制的绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1341
msgid "Copy the selected drawing in the following frame by doing one of the following:"
msgstr "通过以下任一方式在下一帧中复制所选绘图："

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1343
msgid "Choose Cells  →  **Duplicate Drawing**."
msgstr "选择 单元格 → **复制绘图**。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1345
msgid "Choose Edit  →  **Copy**, then select the following frame and choose **Paste**."
msgstr "选择 编辑 → **复制**，然后选择下一帧并选择**粘贴**。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1347
msgid "Select the new drawing in the Level Strip."
msgstr "在层级条中选择新绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1349
msgid "Use modifier tools to modify the drawing."
msgstr "使用修改工具修改绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1351
msgid "Go on duplicating and modifying drawings until you complete the animation level."
msgstr "继续复制和修改绘图，直到完成动画层级。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1357
msgid "Using the In-betweener with Vector Drawings"
msgstr "对矢量绘图使用中间画生成器"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1358
msgid "An animation technique reserved to vector animation levels is the use of the **Inbetween** command. Inbetween creates in-between drawings from the two extremes of a range of selected frames in the Level Strip."
msgstr "中间画是一种专用于矢量动画层级的技术，它使用**中间画**命令。中间画根据层级条中一系列选定帧的两个极端创建中间绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1360
msgid ""
"When more than two frames are selected in the Level Strip, a vertical strip labeled **INBETWEEN** is displayed on the right of each frame. By clicking on it, all frames between the first and the last selected, will be "
"overwritten by images interpolating from the first to the last drawings."
msgstr "在层级条中选择超过两帧时，每帧右侧会显示一个标记为**中间画**的垂直条带。单击它时，从第一帧到最后一帧之间的所有帧都将被从第一个绘图到最后一个绘图插值生成的图像覆盖。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1364
msgid "Duplicate a drawing; modify it; insert blank frames; select the frame range, then click the INBETWEEN vertical bar."
msgstr "复制绘图；修改它；插入空白帧；选择帧范围，然后单击中间画垂直条带。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1366
msgid ""
"The interpolated drawings are created by taking into account the number of the strokes, and the strokes' direction. This means that the result will depend on the way drawings were made. For example if the first image is a "
"single shape drawn clockwise, and the last is another shape, you will get different results depending on the way it was drawn, clockwise or counterclockwise."
msgstr "插值绘图是通过考虑笔触数量和笔触方向创建的。这意味着结果将取决于绘图的方式。例如，如果第一个图像是按顺时针方向绘制的单个形状，而最后一个是另一个形状，则根据其绘制方式（顺时针或逆时针），您将得到不同的结果。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1368
msgid ""
"To obtain the best results with complex drawings, copy the drawing you want to interpolate from, and paste it in another frame of the level strip. Modify the pasted drawing without adding and deleting strokes, but only "
"distorting and moving existing strokes (see  :ref:`Editing Drawings <editing_drawings>`  ). Select the whole range and then perform the interpolation."
msgstr "要对复杂绘图获得最佳效果，请复制要从中插值的绘图，并将其粘贴到层级条的另一帧中。修改粘贴的绘图时不要添加或删除笔触，仅扭曲和移动现有笔触（参见 :ref:`编辑绘图 <editing_drawings>`）。然后选择整个范围并执行插值。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1370
msgid "The interpolation acceleration can be controlled in the dialog that opens prior to performing in-betweening. Options are the following:"
msgstr "插值加速度可以在执行中间画之前打开的对话框中进行控制。选项如下："

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1372
msgid "**Linear**, for a constant interpolation."
msgstr "**线性**，用于恒定插值。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1374
msgid "**Ease In**, for an interpolation starting slowly, then getting faster."
msgstr "**缓入**，用于插值开始时缓慢，然后逐渐加快。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1376
msgid "**Ease Out**, for an interpolation starting quickly, then getting slower."
msgstr "**缓出**，用于插值开始时快速，然后逐渐减慢。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1378
msgid "**Ease In / Ease Out**, for an interpolation starting slowly, getting faster, then getting slower again."
msgstr "**缓入/缓出**，用于插值开始时缓慢，逐渐加快，然后再逐渐减慢。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1380
msgid "If you want the interpolation to happen slower or faster, you can insert frames, or cut them, and use the in-betweener again."
msgstr "如果希望插值更慢或更快，可以插入帧或剪切帧，然后再次使用中间画生成器。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1382
msgid "**To create in-between drawings:**"
msgstr "**创建中间画：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1384
msgid "Select the level where you want to perform interpolation."
msgstr "选择要执行插值的层级。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1386
msgid ""
"In the Level Strip select the frame range, from the drawing you want to interpolate from, to the one you want to interpolate to. If you want the interpolation to last more frames, make room for more drawings with the Edit  →  "
"**Insert** command."
msgstr "在层级条中选择帧范围，从要插值的起始绘图到结束绘图。如果希望插值持续更多帧，请使用编辑 → **插入**命令为更多绘图腾出空间。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1388
msgid "Click the vertical strip labeled **INBETWEEN** displayed on the right of the frame range selection."
msgstr "单击显示在帧范围选择右侧的标记为**中间画**的垂直条带。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1390
msgid "Select the **Interpolation:** mode among **Linear**, **Ease In**, **Ease Out**, **Ease In / Esase Out**, and click the **Inbetween** button."
msgstr "在**线性**、**缓入**、**缓出**、**缓入/缓出**中选择**插值：**模式，然后单击**中间画**按钮。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1392
msgid "**To optimize the in-betweening process:**"
msgstr "**优化中间画生成过程：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1394
msgid "Create and paint the drawing you want to interpolate from."
msgstr "创建并上色要从中插值的绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1398
msgid "**Copy** and **Paste** it in another frame of the Level Strip, considering the number of in-between drawings you want to achieve."
msgstr "**复制**并**粘贴**到层级条的另一帧中，同时考虑要实现的中间画数量。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1400
msgid "**Duplicate** it and insert as many empty frames as the number of in-between drawings you want to achieve."
msgstr "**复制**它，并插入与要实现的中间画数量相同的空帧。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1402
msgid "Modify the pasted or duplicated drawing using the modifier tools, to create the final drawing of the interpolation."
msgstr "使用修改工具修改粘贴或复制的绘图，以创建插值的最终绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1404
msgid "Select the frame range from the drawing you want to interpolate from, to the one you want to interpolate to."
msgstr "选择帧范围，从要插值的起始绘图到结束绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1406
msgid "Click the vertical **INBETWEEN** strip displayed on the right of the frame range selection."
msgstr "单击显示在帧范围选择右侧的**中间画**垂直条带。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1412
msgid "Rotoscoping"
msgstr "转描"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1413
msgid "Rotoscoping consists of tracing drawings taking a live clip as reference."
msgstr "转描是指以实拍片段为参考进行描摹绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1417
msgid "Using the rotoscoping technique to trace the movement of a hand."
msgstr "使用转描技术描摹手的运动。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1419
msgid ""
"As you can import clips and image sequences in a scene, you can simply load them, and create an animation level by drawing in the Viewer, while the frames of the clips are visible underneath. See  :ref:`Using the File Browser "
"<using_the_file_browser>`  ."
msgstr "由于可以在场景中导入片段和图像序列，只需加载它们，然后在检视器中绘制以创建动画层级，同时片段帧在下方可见。参见 :ref:`使用文件浏览器 <using_the_file_browser>`。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1421
msgid ""
"The way to obtain best results is not trying to reproduce with fidelity the clip, but to use its frames just as a reference to better understand the movement or the transformation of the clip’s subject. In this way you can "
"take advantage, for example, of a natural movement represented in the clip, without renouncing an expressive drawing style."
msgstr "获得最佳效果的方法不是试图忠实地复制片段，而是将其帧仅用作参考，以更好地理解片段主体的运动或变换。这样，例如，您可以利用片段中表现的自然运动，同时不放弃富有表现力的绘图风格。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1423
msgid "**To perform rotoscoping:**"
msgstr "**执行转描：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1425
msgid "Load a video clip or image sequence in an Xsheet column (or Timeline layer)."
msgstr "将视频片段或图像序列加载到摄影表列（或时间轴图层）中。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1427
msgid ""
"In the Xsheet/Timeline select a cell in a column on the right of the column (or in a layer on top of the layer) containing the clip you loaded. The image of the clip placed at the same frame of the cell you selected will be "
"visible in the Viewer while you're drawing."
msgstr "在摄影表/时间轴中，选择包含所加载片段的列右侧列（或图层上方图层）中的一个单元格。您所选单元格相同帧的片段图像将在您绘制时显示在检视器中。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1429
msgid "Create a new animation level and use tools to trace the first drawing in the Viewer."
msgstr "创建新的动画层级并使用工具在检视器中描摹第一张绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1431
msgid "Move to subsequent frames, and trace the next drawings."
msgstr "移动到后续帧，并描摹下一张绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1437
msgid "Cloning Levels"
msgstr "克隆层级"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1438
msgid ""
"Sometimes it may be useful to create a clone of a level, or a part of it, in order to edit it without affecting the original one. For example you may want to create a new animation level starting from the drawings of another "
"level, in order to have two sequences similar but not identical."
msgstr "有时创建层级或其部分的克隆可能很有用，以便在不影响原始层级的情况下进行编辑。例如，您可能希望从另一个层级的绘图开始创建新的动画层级，以获得相似但不完全相同的两个序列。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1440
msgid ""
"The **Clone Cells** command allows you to create an independent copy of the selected cells, preserving the numbering order and assigning a new name to it. The **_clone** suffix appended to the name of the level is the default."
msgstr "**克隆单元格**命令允许您创建所选单元格的独立副本，保留编号顺序并为其分配新名称。默认情况下，会在层级名称后附加 **_clone** 后缀。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1442
msgid ""
"The cloned level will contain *only drawings exposed in the selected cells*, even if the original level is composed of more drawings; they will be automatically exposed in the column on the right (or layer on top) of the "
"selection, shifting the following columns/layers."
msgstr "克隆的层级将*仅包含选定单元格中曝光的绘图*，即使原始层级由更多绘图组成；它们将自动曝光在选定区域右侧的列（或上方的图层）中，并移动后续列/图层。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1444
msgid ""
"The new level will be available in the Scene Cast as a new element; it will be saved in the **+drawings** or **+extras** default folder, according to the format of the original file, as soon as you save it with the **Save "
"Level** command, or you save the scene."
msgstr "新层级将在场景演员表中作为新元素提供；根据原始文件的格式，一旦使用**保存层级**命令保存它或保存场景，它将保存在**+drawings**或**+extras**默认文件夹中。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1446
msgid ""
"The cell selection can also spread over several columns/layers: in this case the same number of new columns/layers will be inserted to make room for the cloning result. If more than one level is selected, the same number of "
"new levels will be created and it's not possible to assign a name to the cloned levels."
msgstr "单元格选择也可以跨越多个列/图层：在这种情况下，将插入相同数量的新列/图层以为克隆结果腾出空间。如果选择了多个层级，将创建相同数量的新层级，并且无法为克隆的层级分配名称。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1448
msgid "**To clone levels:**"
msgstr "**克隆层级：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1450
msgid "Select the cells you want to clone."
msgstr "选择要克隆的单元格。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1452
msgid "Choose Cells  →  **Clone Cells**."
msgstr "选择 单元格 → **克隆单元格**。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1454
msgid "Enter a **Level Name:** and press **OK** to confirm."
msgstr "输入**层级名称：**并按**确定**确认。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1460
msgid "Using Onion Skin"
msgstr "使用洋葱皮"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1461
msgid "If you want to view more than one level drawing at the same time in the Viewer as reference when you create drawings, or you want to check the animation, you can activate the Onion Skin mode."
msgstr "如果希望在创建绘图时同时在检视器中查看多个层级绘图作为参考，或者想检查动画，可以激活洋葱皮模式。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1463
msgid ""
"The Onion Skin is available both in the Xsheet/Timeline and in the Level Strip, according to where the cursor showing the current frame is displayed, as the onion skin can be activated starting from the cursor and managed in "
"the frame number column/bar."
msgstr "洋葱皮在摄影表/时间轴和层级条中都可用，具体取决于显示当前帧光标的位置，因为洋葱皮可以从光标开始激活，并在帧数列/栏中管理。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1467
msgid "A column animation displayed with the relative Onion Skin set for 6 previous frames, step two, and an absolute Onion Skin set at frame 35."
msgstr "显示一个列动画，其中相对洋葱皮设置为前 6 帧，步长为 2，以及一个绝对洋葱皮设置在帧 35。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1469
msgid "When a frame of the Level Strip is selected, the onion skin applies to the *current level* only, referring to the sequence of the full animation level as it was created."
msgstr "当选择层级条中的一帧时，洋葱皮仅适用于*当前层级*，指的是完整动画层级创建时的序列。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1471
msgid ""
"When a cell of the Xsheet/Timeline is selected, the onion skin applies to the current level, according to how the drawing sequence is exposed in the scene, including movements and transformations performed thanks to the object "
"animation (see  :ref:`Animating Objects <animating_objects>`  ), while the rest of the scene in the current frame will be visible as usual. If you want, you can also extend the onion skin to the whole content of the Xsheet/"
"Timeline, to allow references to all of the animated or moving elements in the scene as well."
msgstr ""
"当选择摄影表/时间轴中的一个单元格时，洋葱皮将根据绘图序列在场景中的曝光方式应用于当前层级，包括通过对象动画执行的运动和变换（参见 :ref:`对象动画 <animating_objects>`），而当前帧中场景的其余部分将照常可见。如果需要，也可以将洋葱"
"皮扩展到摄影表/时间轴的整个内容，以便同时参考场景中所有动画或移动的元素。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1473
msgid ""
"The *relative* Onion Skin mode displays frames in relation to the position of the current frame. For instance you can activate the frame previous to the current one, and every time you change the current frame, the previous "
"frame will be displayed."
msgstr "*相对*洋葱皮模式根据当前帧的位置显示帧。例如，可以激活当前帧的前一帧，每次更改当前帧时，都会显示前一帧。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1475
msgid ""
"The *fixed* Onion Skin mode displays the selected frame independently from the current frame. For instance you can activate frame 5, and every time you change the current frame, frame 5 will be displayed in Onion Skin mode."
msgstr "*固定*洋葱皮模式独立于当前帧显示选定的帧。例如，可以激活帧 5，每次更改当前帧时，帧 5 都将以洋葱皮模式显示。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1477
msgid ""
"The way images are displayed in Onion Skin mode can be customized in the Preferences... → Onion Skin section. It's possible to define the **Paper Thickness**, to set an independent color correction for previous and following "
"frames, and to **Display Lines Only** for Toonz Vector and Toonz Raster."
msgstr "可以在首选项... → 洋葱皮部分自定义洋葱皮模式下图像的显示方式。可以定义**纸张厚度**，为前后帧设置独立的颜色校正，以及为 Toonz 矢量和 Toonz 栅格设置**仅显示线条**。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1479
msgid "**To activate or deactivate frames in Relative Onion Skin mode:**"
msgstr "**在相对洋葱皮模式下激活或停用帧：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1483
msgid "In the Xsheet, click the small romboid markers available to the left of the frames column (or above the frame bar in the Timeline). Click and drag automatically activates or deactivates a series of frames."
msgstr "在摄影表中，单击帧列左侧（或时间轴帧栏上方）可用的菱形小标记。单击并拖动可自动激活或停用一系列帧。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1485
msgid "In the Level Strip, click the small circular markers available to the left of the strip frames. Click and drag automatically activates or deactivates a series of frames."
msgstr "在层级条中，单击条带帧左侧可用的圆形小标记。单击并拖动可自动激活或停用一系列帧。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1487
msgid "**To activate or deactivate frames in Fixed Onion Skin mode:**"
msgstr "**在固定洋葱皮模式下激活或停用帧：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1491
msgid "In the Xsheet, click the small ghosted romboid markers available to the very left of the frames column (or above the frame bar in the Timeline). Click and drag automatically activates or deactivates a series of frames."
msgstr "在摄影表中，单击帧列最左侧（或时间轴帧栏上方）可用的半透明菱形小标记。单击并拖动可自动激活或停用一系列帧。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1493
msgid "In the Level Strip, click the small ghosted circular markers available to the very left of the strip frames. Click and drag automatically activates or deactivates a series of frames."
msgstr "在层级条中，单击条带帧最左侧可用的半透明圆形小标记。单击并拖动可自动激活或停用一系列帧。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1495
msgid "**To Deactivate (or Activate again) the Onion Skin mode:**"
msgstr "**停用（或再次激活）洋葱皮模式：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1499
msgid "Double-click over the big circle to the left of the current frame cursor. Double-click again to activate it back."
msgstr "双击当前帧光标左侧的大圆圈。再次双击可重新激活它。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1501
msgid "Right-click in the Viewer or in the frames column/bar of the Xsheet/Timeline, and choose **Deactivate Onion Skin** or **Activate Onion Skin** in the menu that opens."
msgstr "右键单击检视器或摄影表/时间轴的帧列/栏，然后在打开的菜单中选择**停用洋葱皮**或**激活洋葱皮**。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1503
msgid "The first time you activate Onion Skin mode by Right-clicking in the Viewer or the Xsheet/Timeline frames column/bar, a default relative onion skin mode activates, showing the previous three frames."
msgstr "首次通过右键单击检视器或摄影表/时间轴帧列/栏激活洋葱皮模式时，会激活默认的相对洋葱皮模式，显示前三帧。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1505
msgid "**To Extend the onion skin to the Whole Scene Content:**"
msgstr "**将洋葱皮扩展到整个场景内容：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1507
msgid "Activate the onion skin in the Xsheet/Timeline."
msgstr "在摄影表/时间轴中激活洋葱皮。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1509
msgid "Right-click in the Viewer or in the frame column/bar of the Xsheet/Timeline, and choose **Extend Onion Skin to Scene** from the menu that opens."
msgstr "右键单击检视器或摄影表/时间轴的帧列/栏，然后从打开的菜单中选择**将洋葱皮扩展到场景**。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1511
msgid "**To Limit the onion skin to the Current Level:**"
msgstr "**将洋葱皮限制在当前层级：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1513
msgid "Right-click in the Viewer or in the frame column/bar of the Xsheet/Timeline, and choose **Limit Onion Skin to Level** from the menu that opens."
msgstr "右键单击检视器或摄影表/时间轴的帧列/栏，然后从打开的菜单中选择**将洋葱皮限制在层级**。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1515
msgid "**To customize the way images are displayed in onion skin mode:**"
msgstr "**自定义洋葱皮模式下图像的显示方式：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1517
msgid "Choose File  →  Preferences...  →  **Onion Skin**."
msgstr "选择 文件 → 首选项... → **洋葱皮**。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1521
msgid "Set a value for the **Paper Thickness** parameter; the lower the value, the more transparent the drawings displayed in Onion Skin mode will be."
msgstr "为**纸张厚度**参数设置一个值；值越低，洋葱皮模式下显示的绘图就越透明。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1523
msgid "Use the **Previous Frames Correction** to set a color for displaying previous frames."
msgstr "使用**前帧校正**为显示前帧设置颜色。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1525
msgid "Use the **Following Frames Correction** to set a color for displaying following frames."
msgstr "使用**后帧校正**为显示后帧设置颜色。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1527
msgid "Activate the **Display Lines Only** option to display Toonz Vector or Toonz Raster levels with lines only."
msgstr "激活**仅显示线条**选项以仅显示线条形式的 Toonz 矢量或 Toonz 栅格层级。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1533
msgid "Using Shift and Trace"
msgstr "使用移动与描绘"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1534
msgid ""
"The **Shift and Trace** function can help you in the creation of animated levels as if you were drawing on paper using a light table; in fact it allows you to use the previous and next key drawings as references, while you "
"insert an inbetween or a break down."
msgstr "**移动与描绘**功能可以帮助您创建动画层级，就像在拷贝台上在纸上绘图一样；实际上，它允许您使用前后关键张作为参考，同时插入中间画或中间张。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1536
msgid ""
"It's possible to temporary move and rotate the drawings you want to use as reference, to fit the position where you want to draw the inbetween. It's also possible to automatically set the position of the reference drawings "
"creating and editing a path of action line."
msgstr "可以临时移动和旋转要用作参考的绘图，以适合要绘制中间画的位置。也可以通过创建和编辑动作线路径来自动设置参考绘图的位置。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1538
msgid "To better check the new drawing and the animation, you can toggle the Shift and Trace visualization on or off the Viewer."
msgstr "为了更好地检查新绘图和动画，可以在检视器上切换移动与描绘可视化的开关。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1540
msgid "**To enter the Shift and Trace view:**"
msgstr "**进入移动与描绘视图：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1542
msgid "Position the frame cursor on the frame where you want to draw the inbetween drawing."
msgstr "将帧光标定位在要绘制中间画的帧上。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1544
msgid "Enable View  →  **Shift and Trace**; the previous and next drawings will be visualized."
msgstr "启用 视图 → **移动与描绘**；前后绘图将被可视化显示。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1546
msgid "**To Edit the Position of the reference drawings:**"
msgstr "**编辑参考绘图的位置：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1548 ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1568
msgid "Position the frame cursor where you want to draw the inbetween drawing and sketch the path of action line beteween your reference points."
msgstr "将帧光标定位在要绘制中间画的位置，并在参考点之间勾勒动作线路径。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1550 ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1570
msgid "Activate View  →  **Edit Shift**."
msgstr "激活 视图 → **编辑移动**。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1552
msgid "Click on the drawing you want to reposition in the Viewer, or use the **Previous Drawing** / **Following Drawing** options in the tool options bar; the related reference drawing bounding box will be displayed."
msgstr "在检视器中单击要重新定位的绘图，或使用工具选项栏中的**前一绘图**/**后一绘图**选项；相关的参考绘图边界框将显示出来。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1556
msgid "Click and drag *inside the bounding box* to **move** the reference drawing."
msgstr "在边界框内单击并拖动以**移动**参考绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1558
msgid "Click and drag *outside the bounding box* to **rotate** the reference drawing."
msgstr "在边界框外单击并拖动以**旋转**参考绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1560
msgid "Click and drag *the center handle* to change the **center of rotation**."
msgstr "单击并拖动*中心手柄*以更改**旋转中心**。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1562
msgid "Click and drag *any corner handle of the bounding box* to **scale** the reference drawing from its center."
msgstr "单击并拖动*边界框的任何角点手柄*以从中心**缩放**参考绘图。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1564
msgid "Repeat the same steps on the second reference drawing."
msgstr "在第二个参考绘图上重复相同的步骤。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1566
msgid "**To automatically Edit the Position of the reference drawings:**"
msgstr "**自动编辑参考绘图的位置：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1572
msgid "Ctrl-click and drag to create a path, from the reference point in the first drawing, to the reference point in the second one. The starting and the ending points will be overlapped at the center of the path."
msgstr "Ctrl-单击并拖动以创建一条路径，从第一个绘图中的参考点到第二个绘图中的参考点。起点和终点将重叠在路径中心。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1574
msgid "Click and drag the handle along the path to change its shape; the reference drawings will move according to the handle position and rotate according to the path shape modification."
msgstr "沿路径单击并拖动手柄以更改其形状；参考绘图将根据手柄位置移动，并根据路径形状修改旋转。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1576
msgid "If needed, use the bounding box handles to fix the rotation of the reference drawing."
msgstr "如果需要，使用边界框手柄来固定参考绘图的旋转。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1578
msgid "Clicking and dragging one of the reference drawings will remove the path of action line."
msgstr "单击并拖动其中一个参考绘图将移除动作线路径。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1580
msgid "**To Toggle the Shift and Trace visualization:**"
msgstr "**切换移动与描绘可视化：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1582
msgid "Activate View  →  **No Shift** to toggle the visualization of the reference drawings back to their original position."
msgstr "激活 视图 → **无移动**以将参考绘图的可视化切换回其原始位置。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1584
msgid "**To Reset the position of the reference drawings:**"
msgstr "**重置参考绘图的位置：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1586
msgid "Choose the View  →  **Reset Shift** command."
msgstr "选择 视图 → **重置移动**命令。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1588
msgid "**To Reset the transformations of one of the reference drawings:**"
msgstr "**重置其中一个参考绘图的变换：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1590
msgid "In the tool options bar click on either **Reset Previous** or **Reset Following** buttons."
msgstr "在工具选项栏中单击**重置前一**或**重置后一**按钮。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1592
msgid "**To Create an inbetween drawing using the Shift and Trace feature:**"
msgstr "**使用移动与描绘功能创建中间画：**"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1594
msgid "Create the first key drawing."
msgstr "创建第一张关键张。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1596
msgid "Create the second key drawing."
msgstr "创建第二张关键张。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1598
msgid "Select the cell where you want to create the inbetween drawing."
msgstr "选择要创建中间画的单元格。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1600
msgid "Activate View  →  **Shift and Trace**."
msgstr "激活 视图 → **移动与描绘**。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1602
msgid "Sketch the path of action line beteween your reference points."
msgstr "在参考点之间勾勒动作线路径。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1604
msgid "Activate View  →  **Edit Shift** and edit the position of the reference drawings."
msgstr "激活 视图 → **编辑移动**并编辑参考绘图的位置。"

#: ../../source/drawing_animation_levels.rst:1606
msgid "Create the inbetween drawing."
msgstr "创建中间画。"
